<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- ZIGUA BBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">MAKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli yedi iwandikwe ni Mako</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mako</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">MBULI YEDI IWANDIKWE NI</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAKO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="im">Chitabu cha Mbuli Yedi chiwandikwe ni Mako ni chimwenga mgati mwe vitabu vine mwe lagano hya diya dikulonga wikazi wa Yesu Kulisito. Chila yumwenga kaitanga “mbuli” kugamba, “Mbuli Yedi” Vyawandikagwa ni Matayo na Mako na Luka na Yohana file ya Yesu ize iheze. Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Mako ni mdumulizo we vitabu ivyo ivine. Iviya vyafanyanywa vyawandikagwa mwe nkongo mgati mwa 65-70 AD. Wawandike walozize wazumila kugamba chawandikagwa ko mzi wa Lumi kwa mwalo wa kuwajela moyo Walumi wakulisito wa uko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iviya Mako amanyike seiviya Yohana Mako, na ni mjeso wa wasigilwa Paolo na Banaba mna ntogozi imlumiza moyo eze aholole mo utafi wakwe wo undima wa kumsankanila Chohile (Nten 13:13). Nyumani Mako niyo atamba naho na Banaba (Nten 15:37-39) Iviya Mako amanyikaga enga mbuya ywa Petulo vitendese (1Pet 5:13). Hata hegu Mako hendaga mukuzi ywa wikazi wa Yesu, wawandike wazumila kugamba Mako kavuzagiza vilozize ukuzi wa Petulo elo uwo nuwo mwegamo wa Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Mako. Mwe mbuli Yedi, Mako alanga umbuya wa wanampina na Yesu, ahinya mwe chipindi cho udumo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vimndani</para>
  <para style="io">Mako kachitambalisa ichitabu sula 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Ukajika Mako atambalisa undima wa Yesu umo endile Galilaya 1:14-8:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Naho alonga kumlanga utafi wa Yesu kwita ko mzi wa Yelusalemu (8:22-10:52).</para>
  <para style="io">Mako abindiliza kwa kuwandika kumlanga chipindi Yesu ekomzi wa Yelusalemu, vihangane na file ya Yesu na kuyuka kwakwe 11:1-16:8.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulonga kwa Yohana Mta kubatiza</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 3:1-12; Luka 3:1-18; Yohana 1:19-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ino ni nkongelo ya Mbuli Yedi ya Yesu Kulisito, Mwana ywa Chohile. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iwandikwa vino mwe chitabu cha muwoni Isaya.</para>
  <para style="q">“Chohile kagamba, ‘Namsigila msigilwa ywangu akulongwele,</para>
  <para style="q">chani akudamanyize sila.’</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Izwi dya mntu akuguta kwe nyika dyetanga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Damanyani sila ya Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q">mchumize wombokelo wakwe!’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohana alailaga kwenyika, akabatiza wantu na kuwagamba kweile masa yenyu, mbatizwe “Chohile nawalekeile masa yenyu.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wantu wose we isi ya Yudeya na wadya wo mzi wa Yelusalemu wambasa Yohana, wamweila masa yawo, niyo awabatiza mo mto wa Yolodani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yohana nakavala suche zisumigwe na mazoya ya ngamiya na msipi wa mkota mwe chigudi chakwe, naho nkande yakwe na ni sije na uchi wa kumbago. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Niyo alonga akagamba, “Eza mntu kunyuma kwangu mta udahi kunijinka miye. Naho miye sikujeza hata kwinama na kufungula sigi ze vilatu vyakwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Miye siwabatizani kwa mazi, mna uyo akwiza naawabatizeni kwa Muye Ukukile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubatizwa na kujezwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 3:13-4:11; Luka 3:21-22; 4:1-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mazuwa ayo, Yesu niyo eza kulaila Nazaleti ya Galilaya, chani abatizwe ni Yohana mo umto wa Yolodani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ahadya Yesu eze afose kulaila mwa mazi, niyo awona kwembingu kwagubuka, na Muye Ukukile asela mnanga mwakwe saviya suwamanga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Niyo izwi dyevika kulaila kwembingu dikagamba, “Weye nuyo mwanangu huungisa, selelwa vidala na weye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Akaheza Muye Ukukile amlongoza na kumwigala kwe nyika. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kekala uko kwe nyika chipindi cha mazuwa milongo mine, kuno Shetani akamjeza. Kekala uko hamwenga na makala ya kumbago, mna wandima wa kwembingu na wakamsankanila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awetanga wanampina wakwe wa nkongo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 4:12-22; Luka 4:14-15; 5:1-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yohana eze ajelwe mndani mwe digeleza, Yesu niyo aita mwe isi ya Galilaya, alonga Mbuli Yedi ya Chohile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Akagamba, “Chipindi chibula,” na “Useuta wa Chohile wi haguhi! Mweile masa yenyu na mzumile Mbuli Yedi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Umo Yesu akajinka mnkanda mwe bahali ya Galilaya, niyo awawona walowa samaki waidi, Simoni na mlukolo ywakwe Anduleya, wakalowa samaki na lwavu mwe bahali.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="MRK 1.16">Mntu akulowa samaki na lwavu</figure> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nitimilani, nami naniwatende walowa wa wantu.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Aho niyo wazasa izi nyavu zawo, niyo wamtimila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Eze awalongwela hadodo, awawona walukolo waidi Yakobo na Yohana, wanawe dya Zebedayo. Nendile we mwe ngalawa yawo, wakadamanya izi nyavu zawo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Aho Yesu eze awawone, niyo awetanga, elo wamwasa tati yawe Zebedayo mwe ngalawa hamwenga na wandima wakwe na kumtimila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mta mpepo</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 4:31-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu na wanampina wakwe niyo waita mwe mzi wa Kapelinaumu. Dize dibule Zuwa dya Kuhumula, Yesu engilaga mwe nyumba yo kuvikila naho yakuhinyiza wantu akonga kuhinya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wantu wose wamwivile weheleswa na mahinyo yakwe, kwaviya hahinyize saviya wahinya Sigilizi wawo, mna enga mntu mta udahi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Aho mntu yumwenga mta mpepo nchafu endile mndani mwe nyumba yo kuvikila akaguta, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Kuna ulosi wani mgati mwako na suwe, Yesu ywa Nazaleti? Kwiza uchikome? Sikumanya weye wi Mkuka ywa Chohile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu niyo aikwahila idya impepo, “Nyamala, naho mlawe mntu yuno!” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mpepo idya nchafu yamsingisa na kumjela msango, aho aguta niyo yamlawa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Woseni niyo wehelwa, wauzana wakagamba, “Vino nimbwani? Mahinyo yano ni mahya? Mntu yuno ana udahi wa kukwamila mpepo nchafu, nazo zamwiva!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Elo Mbuli za Yesu niyo zajendesa kose mwe isi yose ya Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awahonya wantu walozize</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 8:14-17; Luka 4:38-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ahadya weze wafose mwe nyumba yo kuvikila, niyo Yesu hamwenga na Yakobo na Yohana waita kukaya kwa Simoni na Anduleya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mkwewe ywe chivyele ywa Simoni ne mo lusazi hakudaha. Ahadya Yesu eze abule, niyo wamgambila mbuli zakwe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu ambasa, amtoza mkono na kumwambiza kwinuka. Unyonje wamlekela, niyo akonga kuwasankanila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ize ibule chisingi zuwa dize dingile, wamwigaila Yesu wantu wose wendile wanyonje na wata mpepo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wantu wose wo umzi udya na wechisanya ho lwivi lwe nyumba. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kahonya wanyonje walozize wata manyonje yesimile na kugulusa mpepo zilozize. Halekile mpepo yoyose ilonge dyodyose, kwa viya nazimmanya ni yuhi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alombeza echedu</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 4:42-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Luvi dyakwe chilochilo zuwa hedinati kutontomoka, Yesu niyo enuka na kuhalawa mwe kaya. Kaita kuse hantu hehana wantu hachinyele, na kukonga kulombeza. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Elo Simoni na weyawe niyo wamzungula, <verse number="37" style="v"/>weze wamuwone, wamgamba, “Chila mntu akuzungula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo awahitula, “Chiteni hantu hatuhu mwe zikaya zihaguhi. Halonge na wantu seivyo, kwaviya nivyo vilekile heza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Elo, niyo aita chila hantu uko Galilaya, akalonga mwe nyumba zo kuvikila na kugulusa mpepo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mta matana</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 8:1-4; Luka 5:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mntu yumwenga endaga na matana na keza kwa Yesu, na kumfikila madi akamlombeza amwambize. Amgamba, “Ukaunga, wadaha kunilengusa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amfila mbazi, achumiza imikono yakwe na kumdonta. Niyo amgamba, “Naunga,” “Ulenguswe!” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ahadya matana yamlawa yudya mntu, niyo alenguswa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu niyo asunguza kumgamba ahalawe, <verse number="44" style="v"/>amgamba, “Tegeleza, usekumgambila mntu imbuli ino. Mna hita kwa mlavyantambiko akukaule, hegu kuhona chindedi, ukaheza lavya jeleko diya Musa alagise kutenda ukuzi kwa wose wawone kugamba kulenguswa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mna mntu yudya niyo aita akalonga imbuli iyo chila hantu, niyo Yesu adunduga kwingila mo mzi kwa pwilili. Mna, niyo ekekala kuse hantu hechedu, wantu niyo wambasa aho kulaila chila hantu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu aholomale</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 9:1-8; Luka 5:17-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yeze yajinke mazuwa majeche, Yesu niyo engila Kapelinaumu vituhu, wantu weva kugamba eyumo mwe kaya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Niyo wantu wamema niyo hahasigale hantu he kwikala kuse ko lwivi, kubula kolwazo. Yesu niyo alonga mbuli. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wantu wamwenga niyo wamwigaila mntu aholomale enulwe mwe lusazi ni wantu wane. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaviya wantu nawamema, hawadahile kubula hajihi na Yesu. Niyo waponkola kulanga kwedigulu dye nyumba kwa hadya achimaile Yesu, niyo wamseleza no ulusazi lwakwe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu eze akaule uzumizi wananawo, niyo amgamba yudya mnyonje, “Mwanangu, kusizwa masa yako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wahinya Sigilizi watuhu nawehadya wekala wafanyanya mwe myoyo yawo, <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Nimbwani yuno mntu kalonga vino? Amhuluta Chohile! Chohile ichedu nuyo akudaha kusa masa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ahadya Yesu niyo amanya mo muye wakwe viya wakufanyanya mwe myoyo yawo. Niyo awagamba, “Nimbwani mkufanyanya ivyo? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ivyedi ni vihi, kumgamba mta kuholomala, ‘Kusizwa masa yako’, hegu kumgamba, ‘Chimala, kwetwike ulusazi lwako wite’? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Elo naunga mmanye kugamba, Mwana ywa Mntu ana udahi wakulekela masa hano he isi.” Ivyo amgambila yudya aholomale, <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Nakugambila, chimala, kwetwike ulusazi lwako wite kwe kaya yako!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ahadya mntu yudya niyo achimala, etwika ulusazi lwakwe, ahalawa wantu wose wakamsinya. Wose wehelwa na kumtunya Chohile, wakagamba, “Mbuli ino hachinati chiiwone!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwitanga Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 9:9-13; Luka 5:27-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu afosa, aita mnkanda mwe ibahali ya Galilaya, wantu wose wambasa, niyo akonga kuwahinya. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Umo akajinka, amwona Lawi mwana Alifayo kekala mwe kazumba ka kulihila kodi. Yesu amgamba, “Nitimila.” Lawi niyo enuka na kumtimila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Umo Yesu akadya mwe nyumba ya Lawi, fyo dya wachisanya kodi na wadya nawakagambigwa wata masa nawakadya naye hamwenga na wanampina wakwe, kwaviya wantu walozize nawambasa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wahinya Sigilizi awamwenga wendile wa bunga dikwitangwa Mafalisayo, wamwona Yesu adya na wadya wakugambigwa wata masa hamwenga na wachisanya kodi. Niyo wawauza wanampina wakwe, “Nimbwani adya na wata masa na wachisanya kodi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu eze eve imbuli iyo, awagamba, “Wantu hewekulumwa hawakunga mgangana, mna wanyonje wamunga. Sizile kuwetanga wantu wakwefanyanya kugamba wawoneka wedi kulongozi kwa Chohile, mna siza kuwetanga wata masa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kufunga</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 9:14-17; Luka 5:33-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wanampina wa Yohana Mta kubatiza na wanampina wa Mafalisayo nawakafunga. Niyo weza wantu wamuza Yesu, “Nimbwani wanampina wa Yohana na wanampina wa Mafalisayo wafunga, mna awako hawakufunga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Wagonekwe kwe nyinka nawafunge vivihi na msozi wananaye? Havikudahika. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mna mazuwa yeza msozi nauswe kwawo, naho nawafunge.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Hahana mntu akusuma chilaka cha suche mpya mwe suche ya kale. Anadamanya ivyo, chiya chilaka ichihya chadaha kwibalanga idya suche ya kale, na kutenda hadya hantu hatatuke hatatukise. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Naho hahana mntu akujela divai mpya mwe mikwiji ya mkota usakale. Anajela, idya divai mpya naitule idya imikwiji, niyo divai neitike na mikwiji navyo naitatuke. Divai mpya yajelwa mwe mikwiji mihya!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya zuwa dya kuhumula</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:1-8; Luka 6:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Zuwa dya Kuhumula dimwenga, Yesu na wanampina wake nawakajinka mwe zinkonde za uhemba. Umo wakajinka mwe zinkonde izo, wanampina wakwe nawakahasula maiso ya uhemba. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mafalisayo wamgamba Yesu, “Nimbwani wanampina wako wakudamanya mbuli hezikungwa mwe zuwa dya Kuhumula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Hamsomile hohose viya adamanyaga Daudi hamwenga na weyawe hadya wendaga na sala na hewena chintu cha kudya? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mwe mazuwa ya Mlavyantambiko Mkulu akwitangwa Abiatali, Daudi niyo engila mwe Nyumba ya Chohile, adya migate ipagulwe kwa mbuli ya Chohile. Migate iyo na ni sigilizi idigwe ni walavyantambiko awodu wakungwa kudya imigate idya, mna Daudi kaidya na kuwapangila weyawe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Niyo Yesu awagamba, “Zuwa dyo Kuhumula dikwa kwa chausa cha wantu siyo wantu kwa chausa cha zuwa dya Kuhumula. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mvimanye Mwana ywa Mntu nuyo Zumbe ywa zuwa dya Kuhumula.”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu mta mkono uholomale</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:9-14; Luka 6:6-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu niyo engila naho mwe nyumba yo kuvikila. Umo namna mntu mta mkono uholomale. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wantu watuhu nawakalonda mbuli chani wamgwile Yesu. Ivo nawakamsinya wakaule hegu namhonye mntu yudya mwe Zuwa dya Kuhumula. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu amgamba yudya mta umkono uholomale, “Chimala hagati.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Niyo awauza, “Sigilizi zachunga chidamanye vihi mwe Zuwa dya Kuhumula, kudamanya mbuli yedi hegu ihile? Kuhonya ujima wa mntu hegu kuukoma?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna wowo niyo wanyamala dwi! <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu ahituka kuno na kuno na kuwasinya kwa maya. Awafila mbazi kwo udala we myoyo yawo. Niyo amgamba yudya mta kuholomala, “Chumiza umkono wako.” Naye adamanya ivyo, umkono wakwe wata mjima naho. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wadya Mafalisayo niyo wafosa heise he nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, ahadya wadugana na wantu wa Helode, wakonga kulonda sila ya kumkoma Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Fyo dya wantu dyambasa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu hamwenga na wanampina wakwe niyo waita Galilaya. Fyo dya wantu dyamtimila Yesu kulaila mwe si za Galilaya na Yudeya, <verse number="8" style="v"/>na Yelusalemu na Idumeya na ng'ambo yo mto wa Yolodani na ntendele zose za Tilo na Sidoni. Wantu wose awa nawambasa Yesu kwaviya naweva mbuli adamanye. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwa viya wantu nawatendesa, Yesu niyo awagamba wanampina wakwe wamwikiye ngalawa chani wantu wanase kumvigaviga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kahonya wantu walozese, ivyo wadya wose wendile wanyonje nawakafintana chani wamdonte. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na chila mta mpepo nchafu eze amwone Yesu, kagwa hasi na kuguta, “Weye wi Mwana Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mnalo Yesu niyo azikwamila mpepo nchafu zisekulonga kugamba yeye na ni yuhi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awasagula Wasigilwa mlongo na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 10:1-4; Luka 6:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu niyo akwela holugulu, awetanga wadya awaungile, nawo wamtimila. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Niyo awasagula mlongo na waidi mgati mwawo watende wasigilwa, awagamba, “Siwasagula chani mkalonge kwa wantu,” <verse number="15" style="v"/>nanywi namtende na udahi wa kuwalavya wantu mpepo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wano nawo awasagule. Simoni Yesu kamwinka zina dya Petulo; <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yakobo na mlukolo ywakwe Yohana wana Zebedayo Yesu kawenka zina dya Boanege, nikugamba “Wantu wa Mlulumo”. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Anduleya, Filipo, Batolomayo, Matayo, Tomaso, Yakobo mwana Alifayo, Tadeyo, Simoni wa Zelote, <verse number="19" style="v"/>na Yuda Isikaliyote, amhituke Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Udahi wa Yesu walawa kwa yuhi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:22-32; Luka 11:14-23; 12:10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu niyo auya kaya. Naho atimilwa ni fyo dya wantu vitendile yeye hamwenga na wanampina wakwe wasekudaha kudya nkande. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Walukolo wakwe weze weve imbuli iyo, niyo waita wakamgwile kwaviya wantu walozize nawakagamba, “Ni mchilalu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wahinya Sigilizi wamwenga walaile Yelusalemu nawakagamba, “Ana Belizebuli! Uyo ni mkulu ywa mpepo amwinkile udahi wa kulavya mpepo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awetanga na kusimwila nawo kwa mliganyo, “Vino Shetani adaha kumgulusa Shetani mnyawe? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wantu wa useuta umwenga wakatowana wenye useuta uwo naugwe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hegu nyumba inekala mwe mafyo na kuhigana, nayo yagwa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ivyo uzumbe wa Shetani hegu unesenta wenye kwa wenye, naugwe na kubindilikila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Hahana mntu akudaha kwingila mwe nyumba ya mta nguvu na kuguha vintu vyakwe henati kumnyinya mntu uyo. Niyo adaha kuguha vintu vyakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nawagambilani chindedi, wantu wadaha kusizwa masa na kufulu zawo zose na mahuluto yose kwa Chohile. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mna akunga ahuluta Muye Ukukile, halekeilwe masa yakwe, kwaviya kadamanya wihi wa mazuwa yose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu nakalonga ivyo kwaviya wantu watuhu nawagamba, “Ana mpepo nchafu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nine na walukolo wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:46-50; Luka 8:19-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nine na walukolo wakwe Yesu niyo weza. Wachimala heise na kusigila Yesu etangwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu nakazungulukwa ni fyo dya wantu. Wamgamba, “Nyokwe na walukolo wako we heise, wakulonda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Mnala ni yuhi? Naho niwahi walukolo wangu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Niyo asinya wantu wamzunguluke na kugamba, “Wano nawo wamnala na walukolo wangu! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mntu yoyose akudamanya viya akunga Chohile, nuyo mlukolo ywangu na lumbu dyangu na mnala.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mhandi.</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:1-9; Luka 8:4-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu niyo naho akonga kuhinya mnkanda mwe diziwa dya Galilaya. Fyo dya wantu nadimzunguluke naditendesa, vikatenda akwele mwe ngalawa. Wantu nawachimala mnkanda mwe isi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kawahinya mbuli zilozize kwa miliganyo. Mwa mahinyo yakwe niyo awagamba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Tegelezani; Handaga na mntu kakumyaga mbeyu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Umo akamyaga izimbeyu, izimwenga zigwela mwe sila, wadege weza na kuzidya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Izimwenga zigwela mweluwe hene ulongo mjeche. Aho niyo zasunguza kuhota kwaviya nahana ulongo mjeche. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mna zuwa dize dilawe, izimpotela zatoigwa ni zuwa, zinyuluka kwaviya maizi hayengile hasi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mbeyu ntuhu zagwelaga mgati mwe miwa, idya imiwa niyo yasuka na kuzifinta niyo hazeleke. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mna mbeyu ntuhu zigwela mwe ulongo wedi. Niyo zahota na kukula na kulavya ulozo, izimwenga zilavya mbeyu nkanana milongo mitatu, nkanana milongo mtandatu izimwenga nkanana gana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu awagamba, “Tegelezani, mta magutwi neve.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vikulongwa mwe miliganyo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:10-17; Luka 8:9-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu umo neichedu, wantu watuhu wamwivile hamwenga na wanampina wakwe mlongo na waidi niyo wamgamba awatambalisize imiliganyo iyo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Nyuwe mwinkigwa kubunkula mbuli zifisigwe zo Useuta wa Chohile. Mna wadya we kweise weva kwa miliganyo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Chani,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Wakaule, mna wasekuwona,</para>
  <para style="q">weve, mna wasekumanya.</para>
  <para style="q">Uneva wanamanya wadaha kumhitukila Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q">niyo awalekeila masa yawo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atambalisa mliganyo wo mhandi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:18-23; Luka 8:11-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awauza, “Hammanyize mliganyo uno? Haluse namdahe zeze kumanya miliganyo mituhu?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mbeyu ihandigwe nu mhandi ni mbuli ya Chohile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wantu wamwenga wekala saviya vilaile mwe izimbeyu zigwele mwe sila, weva mbuli yedi ya Chohile, aho Shetani awezila na kwiilavya mwe myoyo yawo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wantu watuhu waligana saviya mbeyu zigwele mwe luwe. Waneva imbuli, waihokela kwa chinyemi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mna kwa viya hawana maizi, wajijimiza chidogo. Kunalaila nkunto na masulumizo kwachausa che imbuli iyo, ahadya wauya kunyuma. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wantu watuhu waligana saviya vilaile mwe mbeyu zigwele mwe miwa. Wano ni wadya wakwiva imbuli, <verse number="19" style="v"/>mna nkunto za mwe isi ino na udanti wa ugoli, na tama zesimile zinawengila, vyafinta udya ulosi wi mndani mwawo na kuchinda kweleka matunda. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mna watuhu waligana saviya vilaile mwe mbeyu zigwele mwe ulongo wedi. Weva imbuli, waihokela na kweleka, wamwenga nkanana milongo mitatu, wamwenga nkanana milongo mtandatu na wamwenga nkanana gana.</para>
  <para style="s">Taa igubikwe</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 8:16-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ajendeleza kulonga, “Togolani, kuna akudaha kwingiza taa kunyumba na kuigubika na ntangulu hegu kuika kwedivungu? Togola hakuika halanga he chiya cha kwikiya taa? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Chochose chifisigwe nachilondolwe, na chiya chigubikwe nacho nachigubulwe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tegelezani, mta magutwi neve!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Awagamba naho, “Tegelezani vyedi viya mkwiva! Viya mkuwadamanyiza wenyu, nivyo nanywi mkunga mdamanyizwe ni Chohile, naho vitendese. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwaviya mntu mta chintu nongezezwe, mna yudya hena chintu, nahokwe hata chiya chidodo ananacho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mbeyu ikukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ajendeleza kugamba, “Useuta wa Chohile uligana saviya mntu ahandile mbeyu mwe nkonde. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nechilo agona, nomsi emeso. Mbeyu zahota na kukula, mna hamanyize vilaila vivihi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ulongo wenye wazitenda mbeyu zikule na kweleka, nkongo zalavya mani mateke, vikajika zabwalika maiso, vikajika zeleka ngano. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Izimbeyu zinatoga, mntu uyo aguha nyengo yakwe na kwita kuvuna kwaviya ulozo ubula.” <figure style="fig" desc="" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="MRK 4.29">Mntu akuvuna na nyengo</figure></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa kabeyu kadodo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:31-32, 34; Luka 13:18-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu auza, “Useuta wa Chohile chonga chiugambe wikala saviya mbwani? Ni mliganyo uhi ukudaha kuutambalisa ichindedi? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Waligana na mbeyu ndodo ya haladali, mbeyu ndodo kujinka zose zikuhandwa mwe isi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mnalo ikahandwa, yahota, niyo yakula, yatenda ziti kulu. Dyatenda na matambi makulu vikuleka wadege wo ulanga wadaha kuzenga masasa mwa matambi yakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu asimwila na wantu mbuli yakwe kwa miliganyo ilozize saino, kawagambila viya wakudaha wamwive. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Halongile nawo mbuli yoyose hejeile miliganyo. Mna hadya endile na wanampina wakwe du, kawagambila chila chintu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahoza mjubwaniso</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 8:23-27; Luka 8:22-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mwe dizuwa idyo nechisingi, Yesu awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Chitambuke ntendele ya kaidi ye idiziwa.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wadyasa idifyo dya awantu, wanampina wengila mwe ngalawa umo neli Yesu. Na hana ngalawa ntuhu naziyaho. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kulaila nkung'unto, mawimbi ya mazi yajubwanisa ingalawa, nayo yakonga kumema mazi.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="MRK 4.37">Ngalawa ikujubwaniswa ni nkung'unto</figure> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu na ekunyuma kwe ngalawa, kagona mtwi wakwe wigama mwe mto. Wanampina wakwe wamwinula na kumgamba, “Mhinya, vino hukuwona chasila?” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu niyo achimala, akwahila idya inkung'unto na kuyagamba mawimbi, “Tongomalani dwi!” Elo inkung'unto niyo yanyamala, niyo kwaziziwala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu awauza wanampina wakwe, “Nimbwani mkogoha? Hamnati kutenda na uzumizi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mna wengila woga utendese, walosana wenye, “Yuno ni mntu ywani? Hata mpeho na mawimbi vyamwiva!”</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mta mpepo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 8:28-34; Luka 8:26-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu na wanampina wakwe wabula ntendele ya kaidi ye idiziwa dya Galilaya kwe isi ya Wagelasi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu eze asele mwe ngalawa, adugana na mntu mta mpepo nchafu akulaila kwe zimbila. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mntu uyo naakekala kwe zimbila, hahalaile mntu adahile kumtaliza naho hata kwa minyolo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nkanana zilozize viga vyakwe ne mikono navinyinywa na minyolo ya chuma, mna kadumula iminyolo idya na kuvuna viya ivifungo vye chuma nendile hahana mntu mta nguvu za kumgwila. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chilo na msi nakekala kwe izimbila izo na mwa magulu, akaguta kuno akesenga na mayuwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Eze amwone Yesu kwa hale, amgulukila na kumfikila madi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Agutila kwa izwi kulu, “Yesu Mwana Chohile ekulanga, waunga mbwani kwangu? Kwelise kwa zina dya Chohile kugamba honisulumize!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nakalonga ivyo kwa viya Yesu nakamgamba, “We mpepo nchafu, mlawe mntu uyu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu amuza, “Zina dyako nuyo yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Amhitula, “Zina dyangu ni Fyo, kwa viya chiloza.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Niyo amlombezesa asekuzigala ziya mpepo zihiye kuse mwe isi idya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ho luwala lwo lugulu na hana fyo kulu dya nguluwe dikudimwa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mpepo ziya zamlombeza Yesu zikagamba, “Chigale mwe difyo dye zinguluwe, uchilekele chikengile mwe izo.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu niyo azumila ziya mpepo nchafu zingile mwe zinguluwe izo. Fyo jima dye zinguluwe milongo magana maidi dyasela kwa nguluko mwe diziwa na kudidimila mwa mazi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wadimi we zinguluwe izo waguluka na kuisimwila imbuli iyo mwe imizi na mwe zinkonde. Wantu waita wakaule icho chilaile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Weze wabule kwa Yesu, wamwona yudya mntu endaga na fyo dya mpepo kekala, kavala suche zakwe vitana na nyanyi zakwe zimuwiya. Wantu wose niyo wogoha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wadya wawone diya dilaile, niyo wawagambila wantu chintu chimlaile yudya namta mpepo ne imbuli ye zinguluwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wantu niyo wamlombeza Yesu ahalawe mwe isi yawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu hadya akakwela mwe ngalawa, yudya nendile mta mpepo amlombeza waitanye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo alemela, amgamba, “Hita kwenyu kaya, kawagambile visimo udamanyizwe ni Zumbe na viya akufile mbazi.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ivyo mntu yudya ahalawa, aita mwe si ikwitangwa Dekapoli kugamba Mizi Mlongo na kuwagambila wantu viya Yesu amtendele. Na wose wevile wehelwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Yailo na mvyele adontile suche ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 9:18-26; Luka 8:40-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu eze aite vituhu ntendele ya kaidi ye diziwa kwa ngalawa, fyo kulu dya wantu niyo dyammemela mnkanda mwe diziwa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Alaila mntu yumwenga akwitangwa Yailo, yumwe mwe wakulu we nyumba yo kuvikila Chohile. Eze amwone Yesu, amfikila madi, <verse number="23" style="v"/>amlombezesa akamgamba, “Mwanangu ywa chiche ehaguhi na kubanika. Nakulombeza chite, ukamjelekele mikono ahone atende mjima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu aitanya na Yailo. Fyo dya wantu niyo dyamtimila Yesu na kumfintafinta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ahadya nahana mvyele yumwenga endile na unyonje wa kulawa sakame mihilimo mlongo na midi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mvyele yudya nakatumbwazika vidala kwa wagangana walozize. Kazisa hela zakwe zose, mna hawone vyedi kalumiswa chipindi chose. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yudya mvyele eze eve mbuli za Yesu, niyo omboka mgati mwe difyo dya wantu. Amwitila Yesu kunyuma na kukufya isuche yakwe <verse number="28" style="v"/>akelongela mo moyo wakwe, “Ninakufya du isuche yakwe, nahona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Eze akufye isuche ya Yesu, aho sakame niyo yaleka kumlawa, awona kugamba kahona unyonje wakwe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ahadya Yesu abunkula kugamba nguvu zimlawa. Awahitukila wantu na kuwauza, “Ni yuhi akufize isuche yangu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wanampina wakwe wamhitula, “Waona wantu ivyo wakukufintafinta, nawe wauza ni yuhi akukufize?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo ajendeleza kupagasa kuno na kuno amuwone mntu atendile viya. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yudya mvyele niyo abunkula dimbwile. Ivyo niyo ambasa Yesu akazingiza kwa kogoha, amfikila madi na kumgambila ichindedi chose. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu amgamba, “Mwanangu, uzumizi wako ukuhonya. Jenda mpeho naho utende mjima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Umo Yesu henati kukomeleza kulonga ulosi uwo, weza wantu kulaila kwa yudya mkulu ywe nyumba yo kuvikila na kumgamba, “Mndele ywako kabanika. Nimbwani naho ukumtubwanisa Mhinya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu eze eve yadya walongile, niyo abela amgamba yudya mkulu we nyumba yo kuvikila, “Usekogoha, weye zumila du.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu haungile atimilwe ni mntu yoyose, mna Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana mlukolo ywa Yakobo. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Weze wabule kwa yudya mkulu ywe nyumba yo kuvikila, Yesu awona wantu hewekwivana, naho eva wakwila na kulomboleza. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu engila mnyumba, awagamba, “Nimbwani hamkwivana naho mwaila? Umwana habanike, kata kugona du!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mnalo wamseka, niyo awalavya wose kuse, awaguha tati ya mntu na mami yakwe na wadya wanampina watatu. Wengila kwe chumba wamwikiye yudya umwana. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Amtoza mkono amgamba, “Talita koumi!” Nukokugamba, “Mndele, nakugamba inuka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ahadya mndele yudya niyo achimala na kukonga kujenda. Mndele yudya nana mihilimo mlongo na midi. Ize ilaile ivyo, chila yumwenga niyo ehelwa vidala. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo awaunga wasekuwagambila wantu imbuli idya. Niyo awagamba, “Mwinkeni nkande mndele uyu adye.”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu alemelwa uko Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 13:53-58; Luka 4:16-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu niyo ahalawa hadya, aita ko mzi wakwe na wanampina wakwe niyo wambasa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mwe Zuwa dya Kuhumula, akonga kuhinya mwe nyumba yo kuvikila. Wantu walozize wamwivile, niyo wamwehelwa, wauzana, “Yose yano kayalavya hi? Ni nguvu zani enkigwe kubula kudamanya mpituko zino? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vino yuno suyo yudya msongola, mwana Maliyamu na lumbu dya Yakobo na Yusufu na Yuda na Simoni? Walumbuze hawehano hamwenga na suwe?” Niyo wamlemela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu awagamba, “Muwoni atunywa chila hantu, mnalo kwawe na walukolo wakwe na kwe nyumba yakwe hakutunywa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu hadamanye mpituko yo yose hadya, mna kajelekela wanyonje wajeche mikono na kuwahonya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kehelwa vidala, kwa viya wantu hawazumile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asigila wanampina mlongo na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 10:5-15; Luka 9:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">Aho Yesu niyo aita mwe zikaya zi mjihi, akahinya wantu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Awetanga wadya wanampina mlongo na waidi, awasigila waidi idi. Awenka udahi mwe mpepo nchafu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Naho nakawagamba, “Msekuguha shanduku hegu chochose mwe ntambo yenyu mna nkome du. Msekuguha nkande hegu mkwiji hegu hela mwe misipi yenyu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Valani vilatu, mna mse kuguha suche ntuhu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nyumba yoyose mkunga mhokelwe, ikalani aho kubula hadya mkuhalaila mo mzi uwo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Naho mnengila mwe mzi niyo hamhokelwe hegu hamtegelezwe, halaweni, naho mkung'unte tifili mwe viga vyenu. Idyo nadite ukuzi mwawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Niyo waita na kuwagambila wantu weile masa yawo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wawalavya wantu mpepo zilozize na kuwakuluguta mavuta wanyonje walozize na kuwahonya.</para>
  <para style="s">File ya Yohana Mta kubatiza</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 14:1-12; Luka 9:7-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Helode keva izimbuli izo kwa chausa cha zina dya Yesu nadimanyika chila hantu. Wantu watuhu nawakagamba, “Ni Yohana Mta kubatiza kauyuka. Nivyo vikuleka ana nguvu za kudamanya mpituko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Watuhu wagamba, “Yuno ni Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Mnalo watuhu wagamba, “Ni muwoni saviya wadya wawoni we ichikale.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Helode eze eve, agamba, “Yuno ni Yohana Mta kubatiza nimkantile umtwi kauyuka!” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Helode mwenye nakasigila Yohana agwilwe ajelwa mndani. Kadamanya ivyo kwa chausa cha Helodiya mkaziwe. Mvyele uyo na ni mkaza Filipo, mlukolo ywa Helode. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yohana Mta kubatiza nakamlonga Helode ulo na ulo, “Sigilizi zagamba, havikungigwa weye kuguha mkaza mlukolo ywako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ivyo Helodiya nana maya mo moyo kwa chausa cha Yohana, nakalonda amkome. Mnalo niyo adunduga kwa chausa cha Helode. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Helode nakamogoha Yohana kwa viya nakamanya Yohana ni mntu mta kuwoneka ywedi kulongozi kwa Chohile naho ni mkuka, ivyo nakamwamila. Nakaungisa kumtegeleza, hatahegu nakakangawala chila nkanana akamwetegeleza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Helodiya ketukila niyo apata luhenyo lwa kumkoma, yendaga zuwa dya kwelekwa kwa Helode, chipindi adamanyaga ngasu ya nkande kwa wachimaila wo ulongozi wakwe na wakulu wawa nkondo na wakulu wa Galilaya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mwana ywa Helodiya kengila, niyo aseziga vyedi, kawelesesa Helode na wajeni wakwe. Seuta amgamba uyo mndele, “Nilombeza chochose ukunga, nami nahwinke.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Helode elisa, “Nahwinke chochose ukunga, hata ukaunga inusu yo useuta wangu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yudya mndele niyo afosa akamuuze nine, “Nunge chibwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nine amhitula, “Lombeza mtwi wa Yohana Mta kubatiza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yudya mndele ahadya akumpuka kubula kwa seuta na kumgamba, “Naunga uninke ivino haluse umtwi wa Yohana Mta kubatiza mwe sahani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Seuta niyo engilwa ni usungu vidala, mna kadunduga kulemela kwa viya nakelisa, na wose wendile wehadya nawamwiva. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ahadya niyo seuta asigila mnkondo amwigaile umtwi wa Yohana Mta kubatiza. Niyo mnkondo uyo aita kwe chifungo na kumkanta Yohana umtwi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Awigala umtwi mwe sahani na kumwinka yudya mndele. Naye niyo amwinka nine. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wanampina wa Yohana weze weve imbuli iyo, waita kuguha umwili wakwe na kuuhamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alisa fyo kulu dya wantu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 14:13-21; Luka 9:10-17; Yohana 6:1-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Wasigilwa wachintana kwa Yesu na kumgambila vyose wadamanye na kuhinya. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nakuna wantu walozize wendile wakengila na kufosa, ivyo vimtenda Yesu na wanampina wakwe waswese luhenyo lwa kudya. Yesu awagamba, “Chiteni hantu hechedu chitende wenye, chani mhumule hadodo.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Niyo wakwela mwe ngalawa wowo wenye, waita hantu hechedu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mnalo wantu wenji wawawona wakahalawa nakuwamanya. Niyo wantu kulaila mwe mizi yose waguluka, wawalongwela kubula. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu eze asele mwe ingalawa, awona fyo dya wantu. Niyo awafila mbazi kwa viya wekala saviya ngoto hezina mdimi. Niyo akonga kuwahinya mbuli zilozize. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Umo dikahunga, wadya wanampina wambasa na kumgamba, “Hano chili chi he nyika, zuwa nadyo dyaswa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Walage wantu waite mwe zinkonde ne zikaya zimjihi wakagule chochose cha kudya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Wenkeni nyuwe nkande wadye.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamuza, “Wonga chikagule migate ya hela zilozize zikulihwa mndima kwa miezi mnane hela miezi mnane hegu hela ya dinali magana maidi, chiwenke wadye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu awauza, “Mna migate mingahi? Hitani mkakaule.” Weze wamanye, wamgamba, “Kuna migate mishano na samaki mbili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba wanampina wakwe wawagambile wantu wekale mabungabunga mwa mani maisi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Wantu niyo wekala hasi mwe mabungabunga hano maganagana, hano mwe milongo mishanoshano. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Niyo Yesu aguha idya migate mishano na ziya samaki mbili, asinya kulanga kwembingu na kumjimbika Chohile. Aibesula idya migate na kuwenka wanampina wakwe wawenke wantu. Awapangila wantu wose na wadya wasamaki waidi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Chila yumwe kadya na kwiguta. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Wanampina walogota mabesu ye migate na samaki yasigale ntangulu mlongo na mbili. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Wagosi awodu wadile nendile ni magana milongo mishano.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda mlanga mwa mazi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 14:22-33; Yohana 6:15-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ahadya Yesu awaunga wanampina wakwele mwe ngalawa wamlongwele Betisaida, ntendele ya kaidi ye diziwa. Yeye nendile akawalaga wantu waite. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Eze awalage wadya wantu, niyo aita he kagulu akalombeze. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Zuwa dize diswe, ngalawa ne imgati mwe diziwa, mna Yesu ne ichedu mo mjingu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Awawona wadya wanampina wakwe wakavumba mwe ngalawa, kwa viya nawakahigana na nkung'unto. Mavukuvuku, awalaila kuno akajenda mlanga mwa mazi. Nakaunga awajinke, <verse number="49" style="v"/>mna weze wamwone ajenda mlanga mwa mazi, waguta, wakafanyanya ni chizuli. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Wose niyo wengila woga weze wamwone.</para>
  <para style="p">Ahadya Yesu alonga nawo, awagamba, “Msekogoha! Ni miye! Kwenkeni moyo!” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Aho eingila mwe ingalawa umo naweli, na inkung'unto niyo yaleka. Wanampina wose wehelwa vitendese <verse number="52" style="v"/>kwaviya nahawanati kumanya vyedi imana yakwe yo kuwalisa wadya magana milongo mishano, myoyo yawo na ni midala kumanya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya wanyonje uko Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 14:34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Watambuka idiziwa na kubula ntendele ya kaidi ye isi ya Genesaleti. Aho niyo wajela nanga ingalawa. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Weze walawe mwe ingalawa, ahadya niyo wantu wambunkula Yesu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Niyo wagulukila mwe mizi, kose wevile Yesu kawoneka. Wamwigaila wanyonje wawo mwe zisazi. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Chila hantu Yesu abwile mwe zikaya hegu mizi hegu mwe zinkonde wantu wegala wose wendile wakalumwa mwa magwilo. Wamlombeza vikadahika wakufye idiheto dyakwe. Wose wakuvize wahona.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya wadalahala</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 15:1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafalisayo na wahinya sigilizi wamwe walaile Yelusalemu wadugana kulongozi kwa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Niyo wawawona wanampina wamwenga wa Yesu nawakadya nkande na mikono haikukile kugamba hawahakile mikono yawo saviya mazwela ya Mafalisayo waungile wantu wahake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mafalisayo na Wayahudi nawatongela mahinyo ya wadalahala wawo, hawakudya nkande kubula wahake mikono yawo kubula mwe vinko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Naho hawakudya chochose chikulawa kwe digwilo kubula chinde kusuntwa. Nawakatimila mahinyo yalozize matuhu wahokele, saviya kusunta vyedi bakuli, sazi, nyungu na viya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Elo Mafalisayo na wahinyi wa sigilizi wamuza Yesu, “Nimbwani wanampina wako hawakutimila mahinyo chasizwe ni wadalahala wetu? Mna wadya na mikono mizavu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Isaya nakalonga uwoni wedi kwenyu! Wasongaganyi nyuwe, saviya awandike,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Chohile agamba, wantu wano wanitunya mwe milomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">mna myoyo yawo ihale na miye.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wanivikila vyabule,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaviya wahinya malagizo ya wantu, wakazitenda saviya Sigilizi za Chohile!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Nyuwe mwasenta sigilizi za Chohile, mwatoza mahinyo ya wantu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu niyo ajendeleza kulonga, “Mmanya pwilili ivyo mlemele Sigilizi za Chohile chani mtoze mahinyo yenyu wenye. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Musa alagizaga, ‘Wategelezeni tati zenyu na mami zenyu,’ naho, ‘Mntu yoyose akunga amligite tati yakwe hegu mami yakwe akomwe.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mna nyuwe mwahinya kugamba mntu mta chochose cha kumwambiza tati yakwe hegu mami yakwe, mna agamba, ‘Chintu chino Kolobani’ kugamba, ni malavyo kwa Chohile, <verse number="12" style="v"/>niyo mwagamba mntu uyu aleke kumwambiza tati yakwe hegu mami yakwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwe isila ino, mahinyo yenyu mkuhinyana yabela Mbuli ya Chohile. Naho kuna matuhu yalozize mkuhokelezana mkudamanya saayo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vintu vikumtenda mntu atende halenguke</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 15:10-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu niyo etanga fyo dya wantu vituhu na kuwagamba, “Nitegelezani wose, naho mnive. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hakuna chintu chikumwingila mntu chikudaha kumtenda atende mzavu. Mna chikumtenda ivyo ni chiya chikulawa mndani mwakwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mta magutwi, neve!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Eze ase idifyo dya wantu na kwingila mwe nyumba, wanampina wakwe wamuza awatambalise mliganyo wo lusimo ludya. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu awagamba, “Vino hata nyuwe nanywi hamna fanyanyi? Hamvimanyize kugamba hachihali chintu chikulawa kuse chikumwingila mntu chikudaha kumtenda mzavu, <verse number="19" style="v"/>kwaviya hachikwingila mo moyo wakwe mna mwe nda yakwe niyo chafosa mo mwili kwa sila ya kwe choo.” Kwa kulonga ivyo, Yesu kalagisa kugamba nkande zose zilenguswa zidigwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Niyo ajendeleza kulonga, “Chikumtenda mntu mzavu ni chiya chikumlawa mndani mwakwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwaviya mwe moyo wa mntu kwalaila fanyanyi zihiye na chilanga na ubavi na kukoma, <verse number="22" style="v"/>na uchilanga na tama zihiye na ukankalu na uvambi na finju na kuhuluta na kweduvya na uhezi, <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vyose vino nivyo vikumtenda mntu atende mwihi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uzumizi wa mvyele</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 15:21-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu niyo afosa, aita mwe isi ihajihi na mzi wa Tilo. Kengila mwe nyumba, na haungile mntu yoyose amanye vino ehadya, mna havidahike. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mvyele yumwenga endaga na mwanakwe ywa chiche mta mpepo nchafu, keva mbuli za Yesu niyo ambasa ahadya na kumgwela mwe viga. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mvyele uyo endaga Mgiliki, mwelekwa ywa mkowa wa Silofoinike si ya Siliya. Amwila Yesu aguluse mpepo zi mwa mwanawe. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mna Yesu amhitula, “Ndakuwaleka wana wa mnyumba wegute. Kwaviya sivyo vyedi kuguha nkande ya wana na kudwila makuli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mvyele uyo niyo amhitula, “Zumbe,” Walonga chindedi, “Hata makuli yazwela kudya nkombelezo ziya zihasi mwe meza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu amgamba, “Kwa ivyo uhitule, uya kaya, nokabwile mpepo imlawa mwanawo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yudya mvyele kauya kukaya na kumbwila mwanawe kagona mo lusazi, idya mpepo nananayo imlawa kale.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya hekwiva na chimumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu ahalawa ho mzi wi haguhi na Tilo, na kujinkila Sidoni kwe diziwa dya Galilaya kujinkila isi ya Dekapoli, na kubula mwe si ya Mizi Mlongo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wantu wamwigaila Yesu mntu hekwiva na hekudaha kulonga vyedi, wamwila amwikiye mikono mlanga mntu uyo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Elo Yesu niyo amusa he difyo dya wantu amwigala hankanda, ajela madole yakwe mwa magutwi ya yudya mntu, niyo atwa mate na kumdonta mo lulimi lwakwe. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Akaheza Yesu niyo asinya kwembingu, atoa nkwilu, na kumgamba yudya mntu, “Efata,” Kugamba, “Vuguka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ahadya uyo umntu akonga kwiva na ululimi lwakwe lwalegela na kukonga kulonga vyedi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awalemeza wantu wasekulonga dyodyose kwa mntu, mna ivyo akuwalemeza, nivyo wakujendeleza kulonga. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wose wevile weheleswa. Wagamba, “Kadamanya chila chintu vyedi!” “Kawatenda hewekwiva weve na vimumu walonga!”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu alisa wantu magana milongo mine</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 15:32-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mwa mazuwa ayo fyo tuhu dya wantu dyechisanya vituhu. Weze wantu watende hawana nkande, Yesu awetanga wanampina wakwe, awagamba, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Nawafila mbazi wano wantu kwa viya wekala na miye mazuwa matatu, naho vino haluse hawana nkande. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Uneva ninawalaga wauye kaya hewedile, nawagwe mteho mwe sila, kwaviya watuhu walawa hale.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wanampina wakwe wamuza, “Hano he nyika mntu akudaha kuchinka nkande ya kuchinta kulisa wantu woseni wano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu awauza, “Mna migate mingahi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamhitula, “Mfungate,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Awagamba wantu wekale hasi. Aguha idya migate mfungate, amjimbika Chohile, niyo aibesula besula, na kuwenka wadya wanampina wakwe wawapangile wantu, niyo watenda ivyo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Naho nawana samaki njeche. Yesu azijimbika na kuwagamba wanampina wawapangile seiviya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wose wadya niyo weguta. Vikaheza wanampina walogota vibesulo vigwele, wamemeza ntangulu mfungate. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wantu wadile wendaga magana milongo mine. Akaheza awalaga, <verse number="10" style="v"/>aho Yesu niyo engila mwe ngalawa hamwenga na wanampina wakwe na kwita mo mzi wa Dalumanuta.</para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo waunga mpituko</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 12:38-42; 16:1-4</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mafalisayo awamwenga wambasa Yesu na kukonga kuhigana naye. Wakamjeza, wakumunga awadamanyize mpituko ikulagisa kugamba udahi wakwe ulaila kwembingu kwa Chohile. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu niyo engila chinyulu mo moyo niyo agamba, “Nimbwani wantu we cheleko chino waungisa mpituko? Chindedi nawagambilani! Hahana chilagiso chochose namwinkigwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Akaheza niyo awasa, engila mwe ngalawa, na kukonga kwita ng'ambu ye diziwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Hamila ya Mafalisayo na ya Helode</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 16:5-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wanampina wakwe wajalaga kuguha migate ikuwachinta. Nawana mgate umwenga du mwe ngalawa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu awafunda, “Msinyisise,” na “Mwenege ne hamila ya Mafalisayo na ya Helode!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wanampina niyo wakonga kulosana, “Alonga vino kwa viya hachina migate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amanya viya nawakalosana, elo awauza, “Nimbwani mkulosana mbuli ya kuswesa migate? Hamvimanyize hegu kukombaganya? Myoyo yenyu ichei midala? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mna meso mna hamkuwona? Mna magutwi, mna hamkwiva? Hamkukumbuka, <verse number="19" style="v"/>umo habesula imigate mishano na kuwenka wantu magana milongo mishano? Mwalogotaga ntangulu nyingahi zimemile vibesulo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamhitula, “Ntangulu mlongo na mbili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Eze nibesule migate mfungate na kuwenka wantu magana milongo mine, ni ntangulu nyingahi zimemile vibesulo mlogote?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamhitula, “Mfungate,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Awauza, “Hamnati kumanya?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya tuntu uko Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wabula mwe mzi ukwitangwa Betisaida. Uko wantu wamwigaila Yesu tuntu na kumwila amdonte. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu amtoza umkono yudya tuntu na kumlavya mwe kaya. Eze amtwele mate mwa meso, amwikiya mikono mlanga na kumuza, “Wadaha kuwona chochose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yudya mntu asinya kulanga na kugamba, “Heye, nawona wantu wakujenda, mna wekala enga miti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu niyo naho aika mikono yakwe mwa meso ya yudya tuntu, niyo agubula ameso yakwe akonga kuwona vyedi, niyo awona vintu vyose pwilili. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu amgamba aite kaya, mna amlemeza, “Asekuya ko mzi udya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo ambunkula Yesu kugamba nuyo Kulisito, Mkombola</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 16:13-20; Luka 9:18-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu na wanampina wakwe waita ko mzi hajihi na Kaisaliya Filipi. Mwe sila, Yesu awauza, “Nigambilani, wantu wanitanga miye ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wamhitula, “Watuhu wakugamba ni weye Yohana Mta kubatiza, watuhu wagamba wi Eliya na watuhu nawo wakugamba wi yumwenga wa wawoni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Awauza, “Nyuwe nanywi mwanigaze?” Petulo amhitula, “Ni weye Kulisito.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awafunda wasekumgambila mntu yoyose imbuli idya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asimwila mbuli ya masulumizo ne file yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 16:21-28; Luka 9:22-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu akonga kuhinya wanampina wakwe. “Mwana Mntu aungwa asulumizwe vidala na kulemelwa ni wadalahala na wakulu wa walavyantambiko na wahinyi wa sigilizi. Nakomwe, mna yakajinka mazuwa matatu kulawa ukubanika kwakwe nauyuke.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kawagambila pwipwipwi. Petulo niyo amsenta hankanda na kumkwahila. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo ahituka, awasinya wanampina wakwe na kumkwahila Petulo amgamba, “Halawe hano, Shetani! Hukufanyanya mbuli za Chohile, mna za wantu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Niyo Yesu etanga fyo dya wantu hamwenga na wanampina wakwe, awagamba, “Mntu akunga anitimile, elemele mwenye, enule Msalaba wakwe anitimile. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mntu yoyose akunga akombole ujima wakwe, nawaze, mna yoyose akuwaza ujima wakwe kwa chausa cha miye na chausa cha Mbuli Yedi yo Useuta wa Chohile, naukombole. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Togola kuna loso dyani Mntu anapata isi yoseni mna aze ujima wakwe? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hahana chintu wakudaha kulavya chani wavuzizwe ujima wawo. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mntu akuniwonela soni miye na mahinyo yangu mwe cheleko chino china masa na wachilanga kulongozi kwa Chohile, Mwana ywa Mntu namwonele soni aho akwizila mo ukulu wa Tati yakwe hamwenga na wandima wa kwembingu wakukile.”</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga naho, “Chindedi kuna wantu watuhu hano hawabanike kubula wawone Useuta wa Chohile ukeza na nguvu nkulu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Umwili wa Yesu wahituka</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 17:1-13; Luka 9:28-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yeze yajinke mazuwa mtandatu, Yesu awaguha Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana, waitanya kulanga ko lugulu, hantu nawechedu. Hadya mwili wa Yesu wahitukila mwa meso yawo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Suche zakwe nazikang'alisa, ukung'ala uko hahana mntu yoyose mwe isi akudaha kunyukula suche zing'ale se ivyo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Niyo wanampina wadya watatu wawawona Eliya na Musa wakasimwila na Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Petulo amgamba Yesu, “Mhinyi, vitenda vyedi suwe chikale hano. Chizenge mahema matatu, dimwenga dyako, dimwenga dya Musa na dimwenga dya Eliya.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Petulo na weyawe nawogoha vidala vilekile asekumanya dyo kulonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Niyo kwalaila ingu dyawagubika, na izwi dyevika mwe diya idiingu kugamba, “Yuno nuyo mwanangu huungisa, mwetegelezeni!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ahadya weze wapagase, hawamwone mntu mna Yesu ichedu hamwenga na wowo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Umo wakasela kulawa ko ulugulu, Yesu awagamba, “Msekumgambila mntu yoyose icho muwone aho Mwana Mntu hadya akunga auyuke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wazumila viya awagambile, mna mgati mwawo wauzana, “Kuno ‘Kuuyuka’ ni mbwani?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Niyo wamuza Yesu, “Kwa mbwani wahinyi wa sigilizi wagamba Eliya aungigwa akonge kwiza?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Awahitula, “Chindedi Eliya nakonge kwiza kwika mbuli zose vyedi, mna ni mbwani Mawandiko Yakukile yakugamba seivyo kugamba Mwana ywa Mntu nasulumiziswe naho nabelwe? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mna nawagamba, Eliya keza kale na wantu wamtendela viya waungile, saviya viwandikwe mwa Mawandiko.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mbwanga mta mpepo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 17:14-21; Luka 9:37-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Weze wadugane na wadya wanampina watuhu wasigale, wawona fyo dya wantu diwazunguluke na wahinyi wa sigilizi wahigana nawo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wantu weze wamwone Yesu, weheleswa, wamgulukila kumlamsa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu awauza wanampina wakwe, “Mwahigana mbwani na wowo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mntu yumwe mwe difyo amhitula, “Mhinyi, sikwigaila mwanangu kwa viya ana mpepo ikumleka atende chimumu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Chila mpepo ikemuka, yamgwisa hasi, alawigwa ni fulo mo mnomo, agwegwenya ameno naho atoga umwili wose. Siwagamba wano wanampina wako wailavye impepo iyo, mna wadunduga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu awagamba, “Nyuwe wantu hemkuzumila! Nikale na nyuwe kubula ini? Niwajijimizeni vivihi? Nigailani uyo mbwanga!” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wamwigala kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Ahadya mpepo ize imwone Yesu, yamgwisa chifutu yudya mbwanga na kugalagala hasi, naho kalawigwa ni chifulo ko mnomo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu amuza ise dya yudya mbwanga, “Vino vimkonga ini?”</para>
  <para style="p">Amhitula, “Vimkonga achei mdodo.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Nkanana zilozize mpepo neikamdula mwe moto na mndani mwa mazi. Chifile mbazi naho chambize hegu ukadaha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu niyo agamba, “Heye kwambwani wagamba,” “Hegu wadaha! Yose yadahika kwa yudya akuzumila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Aho tati yakwe yudya mwana niyo alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Nazumila mna uzumizi wangu ni mjeche, nambiza nitende na uzumizi mkulu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu eze awone fyo dya wantu dyawasogeila hajihi, niyo akwahila mpepo idya nchafu, “Weye mpepo chimumu na hwikwiva, nakugamba mlawe mwana uyo, usekumuwiya vituhu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mpepo yaguta, yamgwisa chifutu na kumlawa. Yudya mbwanga kekala enga chimba, ivyo wantu wamwenga nawakagamba, “Kabanika!” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mna Yesu amtoza yudya mwana mkono na kumwambiza kuchimala, naye achimala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu eze engile mwe nyumba, wanampina wakwe wamuza kwa chinyele, “Nimbwani hachidahile kulavya impepo idya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Ni kulombeza kwa Chohile du kukudaha kulavya mpepo saiyo, hakuna chituhu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mbuli ye file yakwe nkanana ya kaidi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 17:22-23; Luka 9:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu na wanampina wakwe wahalawa hadya kujinkila si ya Galilaya. Yesu nahaungile yoyose amanye aho eli, <verse number="31" style="v"/>kwa viya nakahinya wanampina wakwe. Awagamba, “Mwana ywa Mntu nenkizwe mwe mikono ya wadya nawamkome. Mna yanajinka mazuwa matatu kulaila ukubanika kwakwe, na auyuke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wanampina hawadahile kumanya mahinyo, mna nawakogoha kumuza.</para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu ni yuhi?</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 18:1-5; Luka 9:46-48</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Weze wabule Kapelinaumu, wengila mnyumba. Yesu awauza wanampina wakwe, “Namkahigana mbwani mwe sila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mna hawamhitule kwa viya mwe sila nawakahigana kugamba mkulu ni yuhi mgati mwawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ekala hasi, awetanga wanampina wakwe mlongo na waidi na kuwagamba, “Akunga kutenda ywa nkongo, etende mndima ywa kuwasankanila wose.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Niyo amguha mwana mdodo, amchimalisa mwa meso yawo, amkumbatila na kuwagamba, <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Yoyose akumhokela yumwe mwa wawana sawano kwa zina dyangu, anihokela miye. Na akunihokela miye, hakunihokela miye ichedu, mna na yudya anisigile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mntu akuchizumila ehamwenga na suwe</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 9:49-50</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yohana amgamba Yesu, “Mhinyi, chiwona mntu akulavya mpepo kwa zina dyako. Chimlemeza kwa viya he hamwenga na suwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu awagamba, “Msekumlemeza,” Kwaviya hahana mntu akudaha kudamanya mpituko kwa zina dyangu niyo nyumani alonga yehiye mwangu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwa viya hekulemana na suwe ehamwenga na suwe. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nawagambilani chindedi, mntu yoyose akunga awenke mazi ya kunywa, kwa viya mwi wantu wa Kulisito, chindedi nahokele ntunyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Majezo yakumtenda mntu adamanye wavu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 18:6-9; Luka 17:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mntu yoyose akunga amsweseze yumwenga mgati mwa wadodo wano wakunizumila, atende wavu naviwagila mntu uyo atalizwe yuwe kulu mwe isingo yakwe niyo adulwa mwe ibahali. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Uneva mkono wako ukakuhosa udamanye wavu, ukante. Naviwagila kwingila ko ujima wa mazuwa yose na mkono umwenga, kujinka kwingila kwedibome hedina uhelo na mikono midi. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Umo mna wadudu hewe kubanika na moto heukufa. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Uneva chiga chako chikakuhosa udamanye wavu, chikante. Naviwagila wingile ko ujima una chiga chimwenga, ukaleka ukatenda na viga vidi na kudulwa kwe bome hedina uhelo. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Uko mafuza yakuwadya hayakubanika, na moto ukuwoka haukufa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Saiviya ziso dyako hegu dyonga dikutende udamanye wavu, ding'ole. Naviwagila kwingila mo Useuta wa Chohile na ziso dimwe, kujinka kutenda na meso maidi na kudulwa kwedibome hedina uhelo. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Uko mafuza yakuwadya hayakubanika, na umoto ukuwoka haukufa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Chila yumwenga nalenguswe kwa moto saviya nyama ijeligwe munyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>“Munyu ni wedi, mna unaza ulumunyumunyu lwakwe, naujelwe mbwani utende wedi? Tendani na munyu wa umbuya mgati mwenyu, naho mwikale kwa utondowazi.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahinya mbuli za kusola na kwasana.</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 19:1-12; Luka 16:18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu niyo aita Yudeya kugwila mto wa Yolodani. Mafyo ya wantu yamwizila naho, niyo akonga kuwahinya saviya adamanyaga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafalisayo watuhu wambasa na kumjeza kwa kumuza, “Chigambile, vino sigilizi zetu zamunga mgosi amwase mkaziwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula na kuwauza, “Musa nakawasigila mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Niyo wamhitula, “Musa nakazumila mgosi kuwandika talaka na amwase mkaziwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu awagamba, “Musa awawandikilaga mwiko uno ko udala we myoyo yawo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mna chipindi Chohile akaumba wantu aumbaga mgosi na mvyele. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ivyo mgosi namwase tati yakwe na mami yakwe, na kuhangana hamwenga na mkaziwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nawo nawatende mwili umwenga. Ivyo hawatende waidi naho, mna yumwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwa ivyo chilunganywe ni Chohile, mntu hakungigwa kuchisenta.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Weze wauye kunyumba, wanampina wamuza Yesu imbuli iyo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Naye awagamba, “Mgosi yoyose na mwase mkaziwe ywa nkongo na kuguha mtuhu, adamanya chilanga kwa mkaziwe wa nkongo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iviya naho, mvyele akumwasa mgosiwe ywa nkongo na kuguhigwa ni mtuhu, naye adamanya chilanga kwa mgosiwe wa nkongo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awajimbika wana wadodo.</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 19:13-15; Luka 18:15-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wantu wamwenga nawamwigaila Yesu wana wadodo awajelekele mikono, mna wanampina nawakawakwahila wantu wadya. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu eze awone ivyo, niyo ehiwa na kuwagamba wanampina wakwe, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kwangu, msekuwachinda kwaviya Useuta wa Chohile wimwe wantu sa wana wano. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nawagambilani ichindedi, mntu yoyose hekuhokela Useuta wa Chohile sa wana wadodo, hawingile ng'o.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Awakumbatila awo wana na kuwajeleka mikono na kuwajimbika.</para>
  <para style="s">Mntu mgoli</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 19:16-30; Luka 18:18-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Umo Yesu akahalawa, mntu yumwenga amgulukila, kamfikila madi na kumuza, “Mhinyi ywedi, nitende mbwani niuhokele ujima wa mazuwa yose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu amuza, “Nimbwani ukunitanga ywedi? Hahana mntu ywedi mna ni Chohile ichedu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kumanya ivyo mwiko ukulonga, usekukoma, usekugonya, usekubawa, usekumzigiliza mnyawo, usekutenda mdanti, watunye tati yako na mami yako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yudya mntu amgamba, “Mhinyi, natozaga sigilizi zino kukongela udodo wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amkaula na kumunga. Niyo amgamba, “Kuna chimwenga chisigale, katage vyose unanavyo, niyo wawenka wachiwa izihela, nawe nautende na ugoli kwembingu. Ukaheza aho, wize unitimile.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yudya mntu eze eve ivyo, niyo ehiwa, niyo ahalawa kwa chinyulu kwa viya nani mgoli vidala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu apagasa na kuwagamba wanampina wakwe, “Navitende vidala mgoli kwingila mo Useuta wa Chohile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wanampina wakwe wehelwa imbuli idya. Mna Yesu ajendeleza kuwagamba, “Wanangu, ni vidala kwingila mo Useuta wa Chohile! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ni vihufu ngamiya kujinka mwe langa dya singano, ukaleka wagoli kwingila mo Useuta wa Chohile”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="MRK 10.25">Ngamiya</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wanampina niyo weheleswa na kuzana, “Uneva nivyo, nakombolwe ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu awasinya na kuwahitula, “Vino havikudahika kwa mntu, mna siyo kwa Chohile. Kwa Chohile, chila chintu chadahika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petulo amgamba, “Kaula, suwe chileka chila chintu na kukutimila weye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nawagambilani chindedi, mntu yoyose akunga ase nyumba yakwe hegu walukolo wakwe hegu walumbu zakwe hegu tati yakwe hegu mami yakwe hegu wana wakwe hegu nkonde zakwe kwa chausa changu na Mbuli Yedi, <verse number="30" style="v"/>nahokelese mwa mazuwa aya. Nahokele nkanana gana, nyumba na walukolo na walumbu na mame na wana na nkonde hamwenga na nkuto. Mwa mazuwa yakwiza nahokele ujima wa mazuwa yose. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mna wadya wa wakutunywa nawatende wakubelwa, na wadya wa wakubelwa nawatende wa wakutunywa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mbuli ya file yakwe nkanana ya katatu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 20:17-19; Luka 18:31-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu na wanampina wakwe nawemweisila kwita Yelusalemu. Yesu nakawalongwela, niyo wanampina wehelwa, na wantu nawakamtimila nawo wengilwa ni woga. Aho Yesu awasenta naho wanampina wakwe mlongo na waidi hankanda na kuwagambila mbuli zikunga zimlaile. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Awagamba, “Tegelezani, chaita Yelusalemu. Uko Mwana Mntu nenkizwe kwa walavyantambiko wakulu na wahinya Sigilizi. Wowo nawo nawamkantile akomwe na kwinkizwa kwa Wantu sawo Wayahudi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nawambele na kumtwela mate na kumhuta nakumkoma. Mna mazuwa matatu yakutimila kubanika, kwakwe nauyuke.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya Yakobo na Yohana.</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 20:20-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yakobo na Yohana wana wa Zebedayo niyo wambasa Yesu nakumgamba, “Mhinya, chaunga uchidamanyize chintu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu awauza, “mwonga ni wadamanyize mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wamhitula, “Umo ukekala mwe ichiti chako cho Useuta mo ukuka wako, chaunga chikale hamwenga na weye, yumwenga kulume kwako na mtuhu naye kumoso kwako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu awagamba, “Hammanyize icho mkulombeza. Vino mwadaha kunywela chiya cha masulumizo naninywele hegu kubatizwa ubatizo hunga nibatizwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wamhitula, “Chavidaha.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu awagamba, “Heye, namnywele chiya cha masulumizo hungigwa ninywele na kubatizwa ubatizo hungigwa nibatizizwe. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mna sikudaha kusagula ni yuhi akunga ekale kulume hegu kumoso kwangu. Ni Chohile akunga awenke hantu aho kwa wadya awasagule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Wadya wanampina watuhu mlongo weze weve chiya Yakobo na Yohana wendile wakalombeza, niyo wawehiwa. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awetanga hamwenga nakuwagamba, “Mvimanya wadya wakugambigwa ni vilongozi wa Wantu sawo Wayahudi wakulongoza kwa kukundagiza wantu, wana udahi mkulu kwa wantu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mna sivyo ivyo kwenyu. Mntu yoyose mgati mwenyu akunga atende mkulu kwenyu aungigwa atende mndima ywenyu, <verse number="44" style="v"/>na mntu yoyose akunga atende wa nkongo, aungigwa atende mndima wa wose. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kwaviya Mwana ywa Mntu hezile kusankanilwa, mna keza kuwasankanila wantu, na kulavya ujima wakwe chani kuwakombola wantu walozize.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya Batimayo endaga tuntu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 20:29-34; Luka 18:35-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Niyo wabula Yeliko. Yesu na wanampina wakwe hamwenga na fyo dya wantu umo wakahalawa mo mzi, tuntu yumwenga akwitangwa Batimayo mwana Timayo nakekala hankanda he isila akalombeza. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Eze eve Yesu wa Nazaleti akujinka, niyo akonga kuguta, “Yesu! Ywa Daudi! Nifila mbazi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Wantu walozize wamkwahila na kumgamba, “Nyamala, mna agutisa akagamba, mwa ywa Daudi, nifila mbazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu niyo achimala nakugamba, “Mwitangeni!”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwitanga yudya mntu na kumgamba, “Kwenke moyo! Inuka akwitanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Adula mcheka wakwe, apilika na kumbasa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu amuza, “Waunga hutendele mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yudya ntuntu ahitula, “Mhinya, naunga nione naho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu amgamba, “Hita, uzumizi wako ukuhonya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ahadya akonga kuwona, niyo amtimila Yesu mweisila.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu engila Yelusalemu kwa chinyemi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:1-11; Luka 19:28-40; Yohana 12:12-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Weze wabule hajihi na Yelusalemu, hajihi ne mizi ya Betifage na Besaniya, wabula mo lugulu lwa Mizeituni. Yesu awasigila wanampina wakwe waidi wawalongwele. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Awagamba, “Hitani he kaya ihajihi. Mkabula uko, nambwile mwana mpunda afungigwe, henati kukwelwa ni mntu. Mchohweleni mnigaile hano. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Naho hegu mntu akawauza, nimbwani mwadamanya vino mgambeni, Zumbe amunga amjeseze namvuze ivino haluse.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wanampina wadya waita, wambwila mwana mpunda atalizwe ho lwivi hankanda he sila haguhi na nyumba. Umo wakamchohwela, <verse number="5" style="v"/>wantu watuhu wachimale hadya wawauza, “Nimbwani mwamchohola mpunda uyo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wahitula enga viya wagambilwe ni Yesu, na awantu awo niyo wawaleka waite naye. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wamwigala mwana mpunda uyo kwa Yesu na kutandika suche zawo mwe yudya mwana mpunda, Yesu niyo ekala mnanga mwakwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wantu walozize watandaza izisuche zawo mweisila, watuhu nawo wasenga matambi ya miti na kuyatandaza mweisila wakamsingila. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wantu walongole na wadya wekunyuma wagutila, “Chohile atogolwe! Ajimbikwe akwiza mwe idizina dya Zumbe! <verse number="10" style="v"/>Chohile ujimbike Useuta ukwiza wa zumbe Daudi, tati yetu! Chohile ekulanga atogolwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu engila Yelusalemu, aita kwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile na kukaula chila chintu. Mna kwaviya nadiswa, niyo aita ko mzi wa Besaniya na wanampina wakwe mlongo na waidi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auligita mtini</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:18-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Zuwa ditimile umo wakauya kulawa Besaniya, Yesu nakalumwa ni sala. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwa hale awona mti ukwitangwa mtini utimile mani, aubasa hegu napate tini. Mna eze abule haguhi, abwila mani ayodu kwaviya nasicho chipindi chakwe cha kweleka. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu augamba umtini uwo, “Kukongela vino dyelo kubula mazuwa yose hahana nadye tini kulaila kwako naho!.” Wanampina wakwe niyo wamwiva viya alongile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu engila mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile.</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:12-17; Luka 19:45-48; Yohana 2:13-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Weze wabule Yelusalemu, Yesu engila mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile na kukonga kuwagulusa woseni nawakataga na kugula vintu. Niyo agwisa izimeza za wadya nawakasakanya hela, na kugwisa vigoda vya wadya nawakataga wasuwa manga, <verse number="16" style="v"/>naho haungile yoyose afose na chintu mwe nchili ye Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Akaheza niyo awahinya wantu, “Iwandikwa mwa mawandiko kugamba, Chohile agamba, ‘Nyumba yangu naitangwe nyumba nkulu ya Chohile ya kulombezeza wantu wa si zose.’ Mna nyuwe mwihitula itende lundu dya wabavi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Walavyantambiko wakulu na wahinyi sigilizi weva imbuli iyo, niyo wakonga kulonda sila ya kumkoma Yesu. Nawakamwogoha kwaviya fyo dyose dya awantu nawekehelwa amahinyo yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ize ibule chisingi, Yesu na wanampina wakwe niyo walawa mo mzi udya.</para>
  <para style="s">Hinyo dikulawana na mtini.</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:20-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Zuwa ditimile nomtondo, umo wakajenda mweisila, wawona udya mtini uligitwe ni Yesu unyala woseni kukongela kwa amaizi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Petulo akumbuka chilaile na kumgamba Yesu, “Mhinyi, kaula umtini udya uligite unyala!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Mzumileni Chohile. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nawagambilani chindedi, mntu yoyose analugamba lugulu luno, ‘Hita ukedule mwe bahali,’ naye hena nkama mo moyo wakwe, mna zumilani kugamba chiya alongile nachilaile, navitendeke kwakwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwa chausa icho nawagambilani, mkavika na kulombeza chintu chochose, zumilani kugamba mchihokela, nanywi namwinkigwe chiya mkunga. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nanywi mkalombeza, hegu kuna mntu awatendeleni wihi, musizeni wihi wakwe, chani Tati yenyu wa kwembingu naye awausizeni wihi wenyu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mna uneva hamnawausize amasa watuhu, Tati yenyu wa kwembingu naye hawausizeni wavu wenyu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:23-27; Luka 20:1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wengila naho Yelusalemu. Umo Yesu akajenda mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, walavyantambiko wakulu, wahinya Sigilizi na wadalahala niyo wambasa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Niyo wamuza, “Ni kwa udahi wa yuhi ukudamanya mbuli zino? Naho niyuhi akwinkile udahi wa kudamanya yano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Nami naniwauzeni mbuli imwenga, mnanihitula, na miye naniwagambileni udahi uwo ulawahi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nigambilani, ni yuhi amwinkile Yohana udahi wo kubatiza? Ulaila kwe mbingu hegu kwa wantu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wakonga kuzana wenye kwa wenye, “Chigambe mbwani? Chinamhitula kugamba, ‘Ulaila kwe mbingu’ nachuze! ‘Kwa mbwani naho hamumzumile Yohana?’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Naho hachikudaha kugamba! ‘Ni wantu.’ ” Nawakogoha wantu, kwaviya chila mntu nakamanya kugamba Yohana nani muwoni. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Niyo wamhitula Yesu, “Hachivimanyize”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu naye awagamba, “Nami saniwagambileni udahi uno wo kudamanya vino ulawahi”</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa walimi mwe nkonde ye mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:33-46; Luka 20:9-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Akaheza Yesu niyo akonga kulonga milosi ino kwa wadya wakulu kwa sila ya miliganyo, “Hendaga na mntu ahandaga nkonde ya mizabibu, niyo aizungulusiza gwegwe inkonde, asimba bome dya kufumbwila zabibu, niyo azenga mnala kwa chausa cha wachimaila inkonde. Niyo aikodisha inkonde kwa walimi niyo atamba kwe si ntuhu. <figure style="fig" desc="" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="MRK 12.1">Wantu waidi wakufumbula zabibu mwe bome dya kufumbwila</figure> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mazuwa ya kuvuna izizabibu yeze yabule, amsigila mndima akaguhe izizabibu kwa wadya walimi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wadya walimi wamgwila umndima yudya, wamhuta na kumgamba aogole hena chochose. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mta inkonde amsigila mndima mtuhu. Wadya walimi wamhuta mo mtwi na kumjela soni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Amsigila naho mtuhu, uyo niyo wamkoma. Mta inkonde niyo ajendeleza kuwasigila wandima watuhu walozize, mna wadya wandima niyo wawadamanyiza seivyo, watuhu wawatowa, watuhu nawo wawakoma. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Asigale wo kumsigila nani mwanawe mwenye akumungisisa. Niyo amsigila kwa viya nakalonga, yuno nawamwive, kwaviya ni mwanangu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mna wadya awalimi wagambilana, ‘Yuno nuyo mlisi we inkonde. Chisunguzeni kumkoma chani chilisi.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ivyo wamgwila, wamkoma na kudula ichimba chakwe kuse kwe inkonde ye mizabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu awauza, “Mkulu ywe nkonde ye mizabibu natende mbwani naho? Neze awakome wadya awalimi wose na kuwenka wantu watuhu inkonde iyo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Togolani hamsomile mawandiko yano.</para>
  <para style="q">‘Yuwe dilemelwe ni wazesi,</para>
  <para style="q">dihitukila nakutenda yuwe kulu dyedi kujinka yose.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vintu vino navitendwa ni Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q">navyo ni chilozo mwa meso yetu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wakulu wa Wayahudi nawakalonda sila wamgwile Yesu kwa viya nawamanya umliganyo uwo wawalonga wowo. Mna nawakogoha idifyo dya wantu, niyo wahalawa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 22:15-22; Luka 20:20-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mafalisayo watuhu na wantu wa bunga dya zumbe Helode nawasigilwa kwa Yesu chani wakamtege mwe milosi yakwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wambasa nakumgamba, “Mhinyi, chikumanya weye wi mlonga chindedi, hukusinya ukulu wa mntu mna wahinya ichindedi cha Chohile kwa wantu. Chigambile, ni vyedi suwe mwe sigilizi yetu kuliha kodi kwa Kaisali? Chilihe hegu chisekuliha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo abunkula ubala wawo. Awahitula, “Ni mbwani mkunijeza? Nigailani hela niikaule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wamwigaila imwenga. Niyo awauza, “Sula na chinengo na idizina vimuno ni vya yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamhitula, “Ni vya Zumbe wa Lumi.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu awagamba, “Ni vyedi. Mwinkeni Zumbe wa Lumi yakwe, na Chohile naye mwinkeni yakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wamwehelwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli yo kuuyuka kwa wantu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 22:23-33; Luka 20:27-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wantu wamwenga mwe bunga dya Masadukayo, wakugamba hakuhali kuuyuka kulaila mwe file, wambasa Yesu na kumgamba, <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Mhinyi, Musa kachigambila sigilizi ino kugamba, ‘Mntu anabanika niyo asa mvyele mna hana wana, mlukolo ywo umntu uyo aungigwa ampale uyo asigwe, watende na wana wakunga wagambigwe ni wa yudya abanikaga.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hendaga na walukolo mfungate. Awalongwele nakasola, niyo abanika hena mwana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wa kaidi niyo ampala umvyele uyo, mna naye niyo abanika hena mwana. Niyo yalaila ivyo kwa wa katatu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na wose wasigale, wose niyo wampala umvyele uyo, mna haweleke wana. Mwe nkomelezo, umvyele uyo naye niyo abanika. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Haluse, awo wose wakeza kuuyuka mwe dizuwa dyo kuyuka, mvyele uyo natende ni wa yuhi? Kwaviya woseni mfungate nawamsola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Vino mwaga! Mmanya nikwambwani? Ni kwa viya hammanyize Mawandiko naho nguvu za Chohile. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwa viya wantu wabanike nawauyuke, nawekale saviya wandima wa kwembingu wakwikala naho hawasole hegu kusolwa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kwa mbuli yo kuuyuka kwa wantu wabanike, vino hamsomile mwe chitabu cha Sigilizi ya Musa mbuli ya kasaka kakwaka moto? Viwandikwa kugamba, Chohile amkamgamba Musa. Miye ni Chohile ywa Bulahimu na Chohile ywa Isaka na Chohile ywa Yakobo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yeye ni Chohile wa wantu wajima, suyo Chohile ywa wadya wabanike. Ivyo mwaga vidala!”</para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi nkulu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 22:34-40; Luka 10:25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mhinyi yumwenga ywa sigilizi nehadya akategeleza. Eze awone Yesu kamhitula yudya Sadukayo vyedi, amwitila na kumuza, “Mwe miko yose, ni mwiko uhi mkulu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu amhitula, “Sigilizi inkulu ni ino, ‘Tegelezani nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli! Zumbe Chohile ywetu ni Zumbe yumwe ichedu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Munge Zumbe Chohile ywako kwa moyo wako wose na kwa muye wako wose na kwa fanyanyi zako zose na kwa nguvu zako zose.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Na mwiko wa kaidi mkulu ni uno, ‘Munge mnyawo saviya ukweunga we mwenye.’ Hahana mwiko mkulu utendese ikwinga ino imidi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yudya mhinyi we zisigilizi amgamba Yesu, “Mhinyi, ni vyedi ivyo ukulonga. Ni chindedi kugamba yuno Zumbe nuyo Chohile du, naho hahana mtuhu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Naho kumunga Zumbe Chohile ywako kwo moyo wako wose na kwa Muye wako wose na kwa fanyanyi zako zose na kwa nguvu zako zose, na kumunga mnyawo saviya ukweunga we mwenye ni vyedi kujinka kumlaviza Chohile ntambiko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu amanya viya amhitule vyedi na kumgamba, “Hwi hale no Useuta wa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">Eze aheze hahana mntu mtuhu amuzize Yesu mbuli yoyose.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulisito ni yuhi?</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 22:41-46; Luka 20:41-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Iviya Yesu akahinya mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, awauza, “Navitende vivihi wahinyi wa sigilizi wakagamba Kulisito nalawe mo ulukolo lwa Daudi? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Muye Ukukile nakamlongoza Daudi, naye kagamba!</para>
  <para style="q">‘Zumbe kamgambila Zumbe ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q">Ikala kulume kwangu</para>
  <para style="q">kubula niwaike wankondo wako</para>
  <para style="q">hasi he iviga vyako’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Daudi mwenye nakamwitanga ‘Zumbe.’ Vitenda vivihi Kulisito naho alawe mo lukolo lwa Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awafunda wantu wenege na wahinyi wa sigilizi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 23:1-36; Luka 20:45-47</para>
  <para style="p">Wantu walozize nawakamtegeleza Yesu kwa chinyemi. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Niyo awahinya awagamba, “Muwasinyise wahinya sigilizi. Wakunga kuvala nkazu ntali na kulamswa kwa kutunywa mwa magwilo. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wakunga kusagula vigoda vya watunywa mwe nyumba yo kuvikila na mwe zingasu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Wabunyanya ugoli wa wafilwe ni wagosi, naho walombezesa chani wawonwe kugamba ni wantu wa Chohile. Awo kanto dyawo nadi tendese!”</para>
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya afilwe ni mgosi</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 21:1-4</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu na kekala mndani mwe Nyumba yo kuvikila haguhi ne dishanduku dye mpamba, nakasinya wantu ivyo wakujela izi hela. Wagoli walozize nawakajela hela zilozize. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kwalaila mvyele mchiwa abanikilwe ni mgosiwe, naye ajela watundu wakwe waidi wa wahela. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu awetanga wadya wanampina wakwe hamwenga na kuwagamba, “Nawagambilani ichindedi, yuno mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe kajela vilozize mwe dishanduku dye mpamba kuwajinkani wose. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Watuhu wajela viya vitendese mo ugoli wawo, mna yuno mvyele mchiwa, kajela vyose ananavyo, kajela vyose nakasinya kubula chiya asigaze mo wikazi wakwe.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu asimwila mbuli ya kuvunwa kwa Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:1-2; Luka 21:5-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Umo Yesu akafosa kulaila mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, mwanampina ywakwe yumwenga amgamba, “Mhinyi, kaula amayuwe na mazengo yano ivyo yekale vyedi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu amhitula, “Wawona mazengo yano makulu? Hahasigale hata yuwe dimwenga nadisigale mlanga mwe mnyawe, chila dimwenga nadidulwe hasi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nkunto na masulumizo</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:3-14; Luka 21:7-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nakekala ho lugulu lwa Mizeituni akasinya Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana na Anduleya wambasa iche du. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wamuza, “Chigambile yano yose umo nayalaile naho ni chilagiso chani nachilaile chani chimanye kugamba chipindi icho chibula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu akonga kuwagamba, “Mkaulise, naho mntu anase kuwadanta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wantu walozize naweze na kwetanga wenye kwa zina dyangu, wakagamba, ‘Miye nuyo Kulisito!’ Nawo nawawadante walozize. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mneva mbuli za nkondo na mbuli za visimo vya nkondo. Ayo yaungwa yalaile, mna siyo kugamba udumo ubula. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwaviya si imwenga naitowane na si ntuhu, naho seuta nautowane na useuta mtuhu. Nakulaile visingisa chila hantu, naho nakutende nagumbo. Vino vyose navitende enga nkongelo ya usungu wa kwefungula mwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Mwikale meso vyedi. Kwaviya namwigalwe kwe vitala. Namtoigwe mwe zi nyumba zo kuvikila, namchimaliswe kulongozi kwe vilongozi na maseuta kwa chausa changu chani mlavye ukuzi wa Mbuli Yedi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vyaungwa Mbuli Yedi ya Chohile ilongwe nkongo kwa wantu wa si zose. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mnagwilwa niyo mwegalwa mwe vitala, msekogoha na milosi iyo na ivyo na mkalonge, mna longani ayo namwinkigwe mwe chipindi icho, kwaviya ayo mkunga mlonge sayo yenyu, mna nayalawe kwa Muye Ukukile. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mntu na amlavye mlukolo ywakwe akomwe, na tati ya mntu na amlavye mwanawe. Wana nawo nawawahitukile welesi wawo na kuwakoma. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wantu wose nawaweihiweni kwa chausa changu. Mna akunga ajijimize kubula ko udumo nakombolwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Ihizo dya ubanasi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:15-28; Luka 21:20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Mna namumwone yudya akwitangwa, ‘Ihizo dikwigala ubanasi’ dichimala hantu hehekungwa.” Mntu akusoma naamanye, naho amanye ivyo vili! Elo Yudeya wasumkile kuchenya kwa magulu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mntu yoyose kwedigulu asekusela hasi naho asekwingila kunyumba kuguha chintu chochose. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yudya ekwenkonde asekuya kukaya kuguha suche yakwe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mwa mazuwa ayo, wavyele wasoka na wakonkeza nawasulumile vidala mwa mazuwa ayo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mlombezeseni Chohile mazuwa ayo yasekulaila mwe mpeho. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mazuwa ayo nayatendese na nkunto nkulu heinati kulaila kukongela Chohile akaumba isi kubula vino dyelo, naho haize ilaile vituhu! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Uneva Zumbe nendile hahunguze amazuwa ayo, nendile hahana mntu nakadaha kukombolwa. Mna kwa chausa cha wadya wasagulwe kayahunguza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mwa mazuwa ayo, mntu yoyose akunga awagambe, ‘Kaulani Kulisito ekuno!’ Hegu ‘Yudya ekudya!’ Msekuzumila. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwaviya nawalaile makulisito wadanti na wawoni wadanti. Nawadamanye mpituko na vilagiso chani wawadante hata wadya wasagulwe ni Chohile, vikadahika. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Msinyise! Siwagambilani kale chila chintu chikunga chilaile.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana ywa Mntu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:29-31; Luka 21:25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Mna mwama zuwa yadya yakaheza kujinka masulumizo yadya, zuwa nadijelwe chiza, mnenge nawo haumulike, <verse number="25" style="v"/>ntondo nazigwe kulaila kwembingu, na nguvu zo ulanga nazisingisike. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Akajika, Mwana ywa Mntu nalaile akeza mwa maingu kwa nguvu nkulu no Ukuka. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Naye nasigile wandima wa kwembingu ntendele zose kuwachisanya wantu wose wasagulwe ni Chohile, kulaila ntendele imwenga ye isi kubula ntuhu.</para>
  <para style="s">Hinyo dikulawana na mtini</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:32-35; Luka 21:29-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Kaulani mligano wa mti wa mtini. Umo matambi yakwe yakasuka na kulavya mani mateke, mmanye kugamba fula zi haguhi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nivyo naho, umo namuwonele ayo yalaila, mmanye kugamba Mwana ywa Mntu ehajihi vitendese kwiza eho lwivi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mmanye chindedi kugamba cheleko chino hachinjinke kubula ayo yose yalaile. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mbingu na isi navijinke, mna ulosi wangu haujinke.</para>
  <para style="s">Hahana mntu amanyize zuwa hegu saa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 24:36-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Hahana mntu amanyize zuwa hegu sa. Hata wandima wa kwembingu hegu Mwana hamanyize, mna ni Tate du nuyo amanyize. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Chelezani, mwikale vyedi, kwa viya hammanyize isa iyo umo naizile. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Navikale saviya mntu atambile hale ne kaya na kuwasiza udahi wandima wakwe, chila yumwenga kamwinka ndima ya kudamanya. Niyo amsigila mwamizi naye asinyise. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Chelezani, kwaviya hammanyize mkulu ywe nyumba nauye ini, vyadahika vikatenda umo diswele hegu chilogati au chilochilo hegu naho nomtondo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Anauya kwa kwitukiza, anasekuwabwila mgonile. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Icho huwagambilani nyuwe, nawagambila wantu woseni, ‘Chelezani!’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mizungu ya kumgwila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:1-5; Luka 22:1-2; Yohana 11:45-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nayasigala mazuwa maidi hainati kubula Pasaka na yemigate heijeligwe hamila. Walavyantambiko wakulu na wahinyi wa sigilizi nawakalonda sila wamgwile Yesu chinyele chani wamkome. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wagamba, “Chisekumgwila mwe Pasaka kwaviya nawatende nkumbizi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajelwa mavuta uko Besaniya</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:6-13; Yohana 12:1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nemwe mzi ukwitangwa Besaniya, mwe nyumba ya Simoni, mntu ahumaga matana. Umo Yesu akadya, niyo engila mvyele atozize kasupa kamemile mavuta yakupwepweleka vidala, naho yedi ya yombe kulu. Kasupa kadya nakadamanywa na yuwe dikwitangwa alabasita. Niyo akagubula kadya kasupa ka malashi na kumwitila Yesu mavuta ayo mo mtwi wakwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wantu wamwenga nawehadya wehizwa ni mbuli idya, niyo wauzana, “Chiya chikuleka akabalanga mavuta yakupwepweleka saviya ni chihi? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mavuta ayo nayakadaha kutagwa kwa hela ikudaha kumliha mndima kwa mhilimo umwenga hela mhilimo umwenga hegu hela ya dinali magana matatu na ihela iyo niyo wenkigwa wachiwa.” Niyo wamfuzumila vidala umvyele uyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mna Yesu agamba, “Mlekeni. Ni mbwani mkumjela sungusungu? Kanitendela chintu chedi vidala. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wachiwa namtende nawo chila zuwa, mwadaha kuwambiza chipindi chochose mkunga. Mna hamtende na miye mazuwa yose. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mvyele yuno kadamanya viya adahile. Kanijela mavuta mo mwili wangu nyumani ko kuhambwa kwangu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nawagambilani ichindedi, hohose Mbuli Yedi ikunga ilongwe mwe isi yose, chino adamanye nachilongwe, niyo chatenda lukumbusa lwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda azumila kumhituka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:14-16; Luka 22:3-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Niyo Yuda Isikaliyote, yumwenga mwe wadya wanampina mlongo na waidi aita kwa walavyantambiko wakulu akamhituke Yesu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Welelwa vidala kwiva viya alongile, niyo walagana kugamba nawamwinke hela. Niyo Yuda akonga kulonda luhenyo lwa kumhituka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu adya nkande ya Pasaka na wanampina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:17-25; Luka 22:7-14, 21-23; Yohana 13:21-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mwe idizuwa dya nkongo dye Pasaka heyajeligwe hamila, zuwa dyo kuchinja mwana ngoto ywe Pasaka, wanampina wa Yesu niyo wamuza, “Waunga chite kuhi chikaike hantu ho kudila nkande ye Pasaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Niyo Yesu awasigila wanampina wakwe waidi, awagamba, “Hitani ko mzi, namdugane na mgosi etwikile biga dya mazi. Mtimileni, <verse number="14" style="v"/>kubula kaya akunga engile, niyo mgambileni mta ikaya iyo kugamba, mhinya auza, chikuhi ichumba cha wajeni chani nidye nkande ya Pasaka na wanampina wangu?, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Naye nawalagiseni chumba chikulu chikulanga chikigwe vitana, chiikiyeni aho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wanampina niyo waita, wabwila chila chintu saviya Yesu awagambile. Niyo waika inkande ye Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mwe ichisingi, Yesu niyo abula na wanampina wakwe mlongo na waidi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Umo we mwe ndala wakadya, Yesu awagamba, “Nawagambila chindedi, yumwe ywenyu chikudyanya, nanihituke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wadya wanampina niyo wengilwa ni chinyulu, niyo wamuuza Yesu yumwe yumwe, “Hegu ni miye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu awahitula, “Ni yumwenga mgati mwenyu nyuwe wose mlongo na waidi, yudya natweze mgate wakwe mwe bakuli hamwenga na miye. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwana Mntu naabanike saviya Mawandiko yakulonga. Mna nkondo yakwe mntu uyo akunga amhituke. Naviwagila mntu uyo asekwelekwa!”</para>
  <para style="s">Nkande ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:26-30; Luka 22:14-20; 1Wakolinto 11:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Umo wakadya, Yesu niyo aguha mgate, aujimbika, aubesula na kuwenka wanampina wakwe, awagamba, “Guhani, uno nu umwili wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Niyo aguha chikombe cha divai, amhongeza Chohile na kuwenka, niyo wose wachinywela hamwenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Awagamba, “Ino ni sakame yangu ikwitika kwa wantu walozize, itende ni lagano dya wantu na Chohile. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nawagambila chindedi, saninywe naho divai ino yo mzabibu kubula zuwa heza kunywa divai mpya mo Useuta wa Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Weze waheze kuchema nchemo, niyo waita ko lugulu lwa Mizeituni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alotela kugamba Petulo namlemele</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:31-35; Luka 22:14-20; 1Wakolinto 11:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu awagamba, “Nyuwe wose namnisumke, saviya viwandikwe mwa Mawandiko Yakukile, nanimkome umdimi, ne zingoto nazo nazimwaganikane. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mna heza kuuyuka, naniwalongwele kwita Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Petulo amhitula, “Sahwase, hata hegu wose nawakwase!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mna Yesu amgamba Petulo, “Nakugambila chindedi, zogolo hadinati kwila kaidi chilo chino, naunilemele nkanana ntatu kugamba hunimanyize.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mna Petulo amhitula naho kwa nguvu, “Hata haungigwa chibanikanye, sahwase!” Wanampina wose wasigale walonga ivyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alombeza uko Gesemane</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:36-46; Luka 22:39-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wabula hantu hakwitangwa Gesemane, Yesu awagamba wanampina wakwe, “Ikalani hano, miye halombeze.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Awaguha Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana. Akonga kwingilwa ni chinyulu na tumbwaziko. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Niyo awagamba, “Moyo wangu una usungu vidala na tumbwaziko. Ikalani hano, naho mcheleze.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ajendajenda hadodo, edula hasi na kulombeza kugamba vikadahika asekwingila mwe chipindi cha masulumizo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Agamba, “Aba, kugamba Tate, yose yadahika kwako. Nusiza ichikombe chino cha masulumizo. Mna vitende sikunga miye, mna viya ukunga weye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Auya na kuwabwila wadya wanampina watatu wagona. Amgamba Petulo, “Simoni, kugona? Kudunduga kwikala na miye kubula saa dimwenga du?” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Niyo awagamba wanampina wose, “Mcheleze naho mlombezese mnasekwingila mwe majezo. Muye waunga, mna umwili uhwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Aita naho na kulombeza saiviya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Auya naho na kuwabwila wanampina wakwe wagona, wadunduga kufinyula, Hawamanyize wamgeze.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Eze auye katatu, awagamba, “Mchegonile na mhumula? Ivyo! Chipindi chibula, haluse Mwana Mntu enkizwa mwe mikono ya wata masa. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Chimalani! Chiteni! Kaulani, yudya mntu akunihituka nuyo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agwilwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:47-56; Luka 22:47-53; Yohana 18:3-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu nachei akasimwila, Yuda, yumwe ywa wadya wanampina mlongo na waidi niyo abula. Keza na fyo dya wantu wata mabamba na malungu, wasigilwe ni walavyantambiko wakulu na wahinya Sigilizi hamwenga na wadalahala. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yuda alavya chilagiso kwe idifyo nakugamba, “Hunga nimlamse kwa kumsesa, nuyo mkunga. Mgwileni naho mwigaleni kwa kusinyisa anase kuwasumka.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ahadya Yuda eze abule, kaita kwa Yesu na kumgamba, “Mhinyi!” Niyo amsesa. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Wadya wantu niyo wamgwila Yesu na kumtaliza. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mna yumwenga mgati mwa wadya wachimale aguha bamba dyakwe, amtoa mtumwa wa mlavyantambiko mkulu na kumsenga idigutwi dyakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nimbwani mwiza na mabamba hamwenga na malungu kunigwila saviya miye ni mbavi? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Chila zuwa nanihamwenga na nyuwe hawahinyani mwe Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile, hamnigwile. Mna leka Mawandiko yachinte.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Niyo wanampina wose wamwasa, wanyilika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Mbwanga yumwenga egubike mgolole nakamtimila Yesu. Weze waunge kumgwila, <verse number="52" style="v"/>niyo asa mgolole wakwe na kuguluka mwazi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwe chitala cha wadalahala wa Chiyahudi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:57-68; Luka 22:54-55, 63-71; Yohana 18:13-14, 19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu niyo egalwa mwe inyumba ya mlavyantambiko mkulu, aho nawadugana na walavya ntambiko wakulu, wadalahala na wahinya sigilizi. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Petulo nakamtimila Yesu kwa hale, niyo engila kouwa we nyumba ya mlavyantambiko mkulu. Ekala hasi hamwenga na wamizi we nyumba, akotela moto. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Walavyantambiko wakulu na wantu wose hechitala cha Wayahudi nawakaunga ukuzi ukudaha kumtenda Yesu akomwe, mna hawaubunkule. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Wantu walozize na waka mukwila Yesu mbuli za udanti, mna ukuzi wawo hauligane.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Mna niyo kwachimala wantu wamwenga wakaukula udanti ukumlanga Yesu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>“Chimwiva akagamba, ‘Nanitule Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile izengigwe ni wantu, niyo yakajinka mazuwa matatu nanizenge ntuhu heizengigwe ni wantu.’ ” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Hamwenga na ivyo, ukuzi wawo hauligane.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Mlavyantambiko mkulu achimala kulongozi kwa wadya wantu, amuza Yesu, “Hukuhitula chino wakukulonga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo anyamala dwi, halongile dyodyose. Mlavyantambiko mkulu amuza naho, “Togola weye wi Kulisito, Mwana ywa Chohile Ajimbikwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu amhitula, “Heye, ni miye! Naho wose namumuwone, Mwana ywa Mntu kekala kulume kwa Chohile mta nguvu, naho asela kulaila kwembingu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Mlavyantambiko mkulu atatula suche zakwe na kugamba, “Vino chaunga ukuzi wani naho? <verse number="64" style="v"/>Mwiva ivyo akumhuluta Chohile! Chimtende mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wose wamkantila akomwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Wantu wamwenga wakonga kumtwela mate, wamgubika uso na kumtowa maihi na kumgamba, “Bunkula, akutoile ni yuhi!” Wamizi nawo wamguha na kumtowa maihi.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amlemela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:69-75; Luka 22:56-62; Yohana 18:15-18, 25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Umo Petulo nachei kouwa, mvyele yumwenga endile mndima ywa Mlavyantambiko mkulu niyo eza. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Eze amwone Petulo akotela moto, amsinya na kumgamba, “Weye nawe na wi hamwenga na Yesu Mnazaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Mna Petulo niyo alemela na kugamba, “Simanyize, naho sikumanya idyo ukulonga.” Niyo afosa, kubula he chifigwe, zogolo dyaila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Yudya mtumwa eze amwona naho, niyo akonga kuwagambila wadya wachimale aho, “Yuno ne hamwenga nawo!” <verse number="70" style="v"/>Mna Petulo alemela naho.</para>
  <para style="p">Aho, wadya wachimale wambasa naho na kumgamba, “Chindedi hukudaha kudanta kugamba weye hwi yumwe ywawo kwa viya weye nawe wi Mgalilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Niyo Petulo akonga kwelisa, “Nalonga chindedi, Chohile nanidamanye vihiye uneva sikulonga chindedi! Simmanyize uyo mntu mkulonga izimbuli zakwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Ahadya naho, zogolo dyaila nkanana ya kaidi, Petulo naye akumbuka Yesu viya amgambilaga, “Zogolo hadinati kwila kaidi chilo chino, naunihituke nkanana ntatu kugamba hunimanyize.” Agwa hasi na kutula ndilo.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kulonozi mwechitala cha Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:1-2, 11-14; Luka 23:1-5; Yohana 18:28-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Iviya mtondotondo, walavyantambiko wakulu wadugana na wadalahala na wahinya sigilizi na chitala chijima, waika ubala kumjela Yesu minyolo na kumwigala kwa Pilato. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pilato amuza Yesu, “Weye wi Seuta ywa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amhitula, “Heye, ni sa ivyo ukulonga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Walavyantambiko wakulu wamlongeleza Yesu kwa mbuli zilozize, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ivyo Pilato amuza naho, “Hukunihitula? Tegeleza yose wakukulongeleza!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu naho alemela kulonga dyodyose, Pilato naye niyo ehelwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akantilwa kufa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:15-26; Luka 23:13-25; Yohana 18:39-19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Chila chipindi cha Sikunkulu ya Pasaka, Pilato na ana mazwela ya kulekela mfungwa yumwenga wantu waungile alekelwe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwa mazuwa ayo, nahana mntu yumwenga akwitangwa Balaba ne mwe chifungo. Uyo hamwenga na weyawe, nawakoma wantu mwe nkumbizi umo kwatendaga mhigano. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Idifyo dya wantu weze wadugane hamwenga, niyo wakonga kumlombeza Pilato amchohwele mfungwa yumwenga saviya akutendaga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pilato awauza, “Mwaunga ni walekeile Seuta ywa Wayahudi?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nakamanya vyedi kugamba walavyantambiko wakulu nawamlavya Yesu kwa kumuwonela finju.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mna walavyantambiko wakulu walafya na idifyo chani dimgambe Pilato amlekeile Balaba. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pilato alonga vituhu na idifyo, “Mwaunga nimtende mbwani yuno mkwitanga Seuta ywa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Niyo idifyo diya dyagutila, “Msulumize mo msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pilato auza, “Mna katenda mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wose hamwenga wagutisa, “Msulumize mo msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pilato nakaunga adibwedeze idifyo dya wantu, ivyo awalekeila Balaba. Akaheza, amlavya Yesu atoigwe milugwa akajika wamsulumize mo msalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Wankondo wambela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:27-31; Yohana 19:2-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wankondo wamwingiza Yesu kouwa we nyumba ya Pilato, mkulu we isi. Hadya wachintana hamwenga ne chitala chijima. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wamvika suche izambalau, wamdamanyiza chilemba cho useuta chidamanywe kwa miwa na kumvika mo mtwi wakwe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wakalawa aho, wakonga kumlamsa, “Waacha, Seuta ywa Wayahudi!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wamtowa na tete mo mtwi na kumtwela mate, niyo wamfikila madi na kumfunamila. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Weze waheze kumtila, wamvula isuche izambalau, na kumvika suche yakwe mwenye. Niyo wamlongoza kokumsulumiza mo msalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atungikwa mo msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:32-44; Luka 23:26-43; Yohana 19:17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwe sila, wadugana na mntu akwitangwa Simoni, uyo nakengila mo mzi akalaila kwe nkonde. Wankondo wamkunduganya enule msalaba wa Yesu. Simoni na nimntu wa si ya Kilene, naho endaga tati yawo Alekizanda na Lufo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Niyo wamwigala Yesu hantu hakwitangwa Goligota, kugamba, “Hantu ha Ngobela.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wajeza kumwinka divai ihanganywe na mti wa kunywa ukwitangwa manemane, mna Yesu kalemela kuinywa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Niyo wamsulumiza mo msalaba, vikaheza wazitoila tegatega izisuche zakwe, kugamba suche ihi aguhe yuhi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yendaga saa ntatu ya mtondo umo wakamsulumiza mo msalaba. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Halanga ho msalaba hawandikwa malema yakwe, “Seuta ywa Wayahudi.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Seivyo wasulumizagwa wapolaganyi waidi hamwenga na Yesu, yumwenga kulume kwa Yesu na mtuhu naye kumoso kwakwe. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mawandiko Yakukile yakugamba vino nayachinte, “Nakatungikwa hamwenga na wata wavu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wantu nawakajinka mwe sila, nawakamhuluta kuno wakasingisa imitwi yawo, wakagamba, “Ha! Weye mta kuvuna Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile na kuizenga kwa mazuwa matatu! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwehonye we mwenye, usele kulaila mo msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ivyo walavyantambiko wakulu hamwenga na wahinya sigilizi niyo nawo wamtila, wakagamba, “Nakahonya watuhu, mna hakudaha kwehonya mwenye! <verse number="32" style="v"/>Goja chikaule Kulisito, Seuta ywa Waizulaeli asele mo msalaba, suwe nachimzumile!”</para>
  <para style="p">Wadya wantu waidi wasulumizwe hamwenga na Yesu nawo niyo wamhuluta.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abanika mo msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:45-56; Luka 23:44-49; Yohana 19:28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ize ibule sa mtandatu nomsi, isi yose igubikwa ni chiza chibwile kubula saa chenda nomsi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Saa chenda nomsi, niyo Yesu aila kwa izwi kulu, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Nivyo kugamba, “Chohile ywangu, Chohile ywangu, nimbwani ukunileka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wantu wamwenga wamwivile wagamba, “Mwetegelezeni, amwitanga Eliya!” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yumwenga aguluka na lendele dijeligwe mwe siki igwaduke nakwitundika mwe tete. Niyo ainula kubula komlomo wa Yesu na kugamba, “Gojani, chikaule hegu Eliya neze amseleze kulaila ko msalaba.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu alavya izwi kulu na kubanika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Paziya dye Nyumba nkulu ya Chohile dyatatuka vihande vidi, kulaila kulanga kubula hasi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mnkondo mkulu achimale ho msalaba niyo amwona viya Yesu abanike. Agamba, “Mntu yuno ni chindedi ni Mwana Chohile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuna wavyele nawehadya wakasinya kulawa hale. Hamwenga nawo na ni Maliyamu Magidalena, Maliyamu nine dya Yakobo mdodo na Yusufu hamwenga na Salome. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nawakamtimila Yesu umo E galilaya na kumwambiza. Wavyele watuhu walozize wezile Yelusalemu hamwenga naye nawo naweyaho.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhambwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:57-61; Luka 23:50-56; Yohana 19:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Umo chipindi chize chibule. Na ni zuwa dya kwe malanya, kugamba zuwa dikulongwela Zuwa dya kuhumula. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Niyo eza Yusufu mkaya ywa Alimataya, ni mntu akutunyiswa mwe Chitala Chikulu, uyo naye nakagoja kwiza kwa Useuta wa Chohile. Elo, kambasa Pilato hena woga, niyo amlombeza enkigwe umwili wa Yesu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pilato nakehelwa kugambilwa kugamba Yesu kabanika kale. Amwitanga mkulu ywa wankondo na kumuza hegu Yesu kabanika chikale. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Eze amwive uyo mkulu kugamba ni chindedi Yesu kabanika kale, amgamba Yusufu auguhe umwili wa Yesu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yusufu agula sanda, auseleza umwili wa Yesu hasi, auzinga mwe sanda na kuuhamba mwe mbila isongolwe mwe luwe. Niyo afingilisa yuwe kulu kugubika ulwivi lwe mbila idya. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Maliyamu Magidalena na Maliyamu nine dya Yusufu nawakasinya na kuwona aho umwili wa Yesu wikigwe.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuuyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 28:1-8; Luka 24:1-12; Yohana 20:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Zuwa dya Kuhumula dize dijinke, Maliyamu Magidalena, Maliyamu nine dya Yakobo hamwenga na Salome wagula mavuta yakupwepweleka wakaukulugute umwili wa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mtondotondo zuwa dya kuhumula mwe Chigiliki ni zuwa dya nkongo dya mazuwa mfungate. Kwize kutandazuke, waita kwe mbila. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mwe sila wauzana, “Ni yuhi akunga achifingilisize diya idiyuwe dimo lwivi lwe mbila?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mna eze wasinye wawona kugamba yuwe diya dyuswa kale yuwe idyo dyendaga dikulisa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Niyo wengila mndani mwe mbila, wambwila mbwanga availe nkazu ing'aile kekala kulume, niyo wehelwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mna mbwanga yudya niyo awagamba, “Msekwehelwa,” Simanya mwamzungula Yesu ywa Nazaleti asulumizwe mo msalaba. Hahali hano, kauyuka! Kaulani, ahantu wamwikaga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Haluse hitani mkawagambile wanampina wakwe hamwenga na Petulo kugamba, kawalongwelani kwita Galilaya, uko nammuone saviya awagambilagani,.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Elo wavyele wadya niyo waguluka kulaila kwe mbila, kuno wazingiza naho wakangawala. Hawamgambile mntu yoyose mbuli idya kwa viya nawakogoha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amlaila Maliyamu Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 28:9-10; Yohana 20:11-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu eze auyuke chilochilo zuwa dya kuhumula, kamlaila Maliyamu Magidalena, yudya abalazagwa mpepo mfungate mndani mwakwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yudya mvyele niyo aita kuwagambila wambuyaze wendile hamwenga na Yesu. Nawo wendile wache kuomboleza na kwila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Weze weve kugamba Yesu kauyuka ni mjima naho mvyele uyo kamwona, hawazumile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalaila wanampina waidi</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 24:13-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vikaheza, Yesu niyo awalaila wanampina wakwe waidi akatenda na mwili mtuhu umo wendile mwe sila wakaita mwe zikaya. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nawo wauya na kuwagambila wamtimile Yesu watuhu, mna nawo hawazumile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalaila wanampina mlongo na yumwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 28:16-20; Luka 24:36-49; Yohana 20:19-23; Ntendwa 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vikajika, Yesu niyo awalaila wanampina wakwe mlongo na yumwe umo wendile wakadya. Awakwahila kwa viya hawazumile, naho kwa viya nawana myoyo midala kuwazumila wadya wamwonile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Akaheza awagamba, “Hitani kwe isi yose, mkalonge Mbuli Yedi kwa chila mntu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mntu yoyose akunga azumile na kubatizwa nakombolwe, mna mntu yoyose hekuzumila nakantilwe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na vilagiso vino na vitimilane na wadya wazumile, kwa zina dyangu na waguluse mpepo, nawalonge kwa semo mpya, <verse number="18" style="v"/>nawatoze nyoka hegu wanadya chintu chikukoma hachiwakome, nawajeleke mikono yawo mwe wanyonje, nawo nawahone.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu enulwa kwita kwe mbingu</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 24:50-53; Ntendwa 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Elo Zumbe Yesu eze ajike kulonga ayo, niyo enulwa kulanga kwita kwembingu uko kekala kulume kwa Chohile. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wanampina waita chila hantu na kulonga Mbuli Yedi, Zumbe naye asankanila hamwenga nawo na kulagisa kugamba kulonga kwawo nichindedi kwa sila ye vilagiso wadamanye.</para>
</usx>
